␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀4Õ´␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¯␀␀Ë␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, how you doing? You must be the new kid.␀␀ˇˇI'm Pete, Pete Kowalski.␀␀ˇˇJimmy Hopkins and don't ask how I'm doing.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI've been here five minutes and already people want me dead.␀␀ˇˇEven my parents didn't hate me this quickly!␀␀ˇˇWell... welcome to Bullworth. It's a dump.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGreat, I've been expelled from anywhere halfway decent.␀␀␀ˇˇ"Yeah I've been expelled from anywhere halfway decent␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ'cause I'm really bad".␀␀␀ˇˇGive up the tough guy act, pal.␀␀␀ˇˇHey man, what's your problem?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell, A.D.D., primarily, but also life, my parents,␀␀␀ˇˇthis school, western civilization,␀␀␀␀ˇˇbut really, honestly, enough about me.␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh, I see you've met the dorm's mascot.␀␀␀ˇˇLadies and gentlemen, I give you "Femme Boy",␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇthe girliest boy in school.␀␀␀ˇˇPetey haven't you got some imaginary friends to go annoy?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhy don't you leave me alone, Gary␀␀␀␀ˇˇLook at you! "Leave me alone Gary!␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm really self important now that I've finally hit puberty!"␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's your problem?␀␀ˇˇI'm just being nice to the new kid␀␀␀␀ˇˇas he passes through Bullworth␀␀␀␀ˇˇon his inevitable journey to prison.␀␀ˇˇLook, I gotta unpack.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWould you guys mind getting outta here?␀␀␀ˇˇOh, now look what you've done, Pete!␀␀ˇˇJimmy can't stand you already.␀␀␀␀
