, boy, or I shall clean it myself!␀␀␀␀ˇˇMiss Danvers, are you back yet?␀␀␀ˇˇYes, Headmaster. And I got your tea.␀␀ˇˇYou are good to me, Miss Danvers.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNo more than you deserve, Headmaster.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake our new friend Hopkins here␀␀ˇˇand show him around the school,␀␀␀ˇˇand get him properly attired.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCertainly Headmaster.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome along boy, I haven't got all day.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAnd boy, remember, you will have a clean nose,␀␀␀␀ˇˇso keep it clean, or we'll clean it for you.␀␀ŸM´3␀␀␀⁄M´3%␀␀␀€M´31␀␀␀‹M´3I␀␀␀›M´3a␀␀␀ﬁM´3Å␀␀␀ﬂM´3π␀␀␀‡M´3	␀␀·M´3-␀␀[N´3M␀␀\N´3u␀␀]N´3ë␀␀^N´3π␀␀_N´3·␀␀`N´3␀␀aN´3%␀␀bN´3A␀␀cN´3U␀␀dN´3u␀␀ﬁN´3•␀␀ﬂN´3—␀␀‡N´3˝␀␀·N´3)␀␀‚N´3a␀␀„N´3°␀␀‰N´3≈␀␀ÂN´3Ì␀␀ÊN´3␀␀ÁN´3A␀␀aO´3e␀␀bO´3â␀␀cO´3≠␀␀dO´3…␀␀eO´3ı␀␀fO´3)␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀4Õ´␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d␀␀∞␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThere you are!␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on, I found something incredible.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHold on. Relax, man.␀␀ˇˇI can't keep getting in trouble.␀␀ˇˇI can't get expelled again.␀␀␀ˇˇIt's always about me with you! Me, me, me.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm thinking bigger picture, and you're worrying␀␀ˇˇabout getting into trouble?␀␀␀ˇˇYou know what? You really are something.␀␀ˇˇWhat bigger picture?␀␀ˇˇI'm... we are gonna take over this school.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWE are not taking over anything right now.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTime and tide wait for no man, my friend,␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇbut it seems they do wait for a wanna-be tough guy␀␀␀␀ˇˇwho is nothing but a little girl.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're full of it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo you keep telling me, look, now come on.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI promise you, after this,␀␀␀␀ˇˇthings are never gonna be the same again!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh, I'm so excited,␀␀␀ˇˇI should have stopped taking those pills ages ago.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYeah right. 