␀␀(␀␀E␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's Russell's locker. Let's break into it and steal something. That'll teach him.␀␀ˇˇCareful around the prefects.  They don't have much of a sense of humor.␀␀␀ˇˇDidya see that?␀␀␀ˇˇYou!  Go change into your uniform!␀␀␀␀ˇˇRun along now child.␀␀ˇˇOh Jimmy, you're such a loser.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're here to learn, not to goof off.  Get to class.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHmmph.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhoa!  Take the stupid chocolate.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee you later.␀␀␀␀ˇˇBlock & Lock On␀␀␀ˇˇGo to the boys' dorm.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI hate that Constantinos guy even more than the nerds.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go to the caf... I'll show you the local wildlife.␀␀ˇˇLet's go to the caf, I'll show you who's who.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou should probably change into your uniform if you don't want to get in trouble. ␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's Russell's locker.  You know, the big ape who almost put you in the hospital.␀␀␀ˇˇDon't let the prefects see you break any rules.  They'll hurt you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're dead new kid, dead.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe took my chocolate... please get it back.␀␀␀ˇˇHave you got it yet?␀␀ˇˇSomeone stole my one-eyed elf and I need him for tonight's game.␀␀ˇˇDid you find him yet?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on, let's break into it and steal something.  That'll teach him.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDid you get the chocolate?␀␀␀␀ˇˇThanks... uhm... wanna make out?␀␀ˇˇRemember me?  You're dead!␀␀␀␀ˇˇHere we are... the boys dorm.  You'll learn to love it.␀␀␀ˇˇGround Kicks␀␀ˇˇHead Butt␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGrab␀␀ˇˇThrow␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNow fight the bully.␀␀ˇˇMatch the buttons to perform the actions listed.␀␀ˇˇHeavy Attacks␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAttack␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh man, there's that weird chick Eunice.  Let's have some fun with her.␀␀␀ˇˇGet the new kid!  Beat him down!␀␀ˇˇWhere's your uniform young Hopkins?␀␀␀ˇˇDid you get it?␀␀␀ˇˇYou.  New kid.  Money.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHahahaaaa!␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf I don't get that elf back I'll never hear the end of it from Algernon.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI really need that Elf for tonight's quest Jimmy.  We're going into the sewers!␀␀␀ˇˇThat's enough of that!  Break it up!␀␀ˇˇOoooh.  So you wanna scrap?␀␀␀ˇˇThere he is.  Show him what you're made 