␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on, little brain, this way.␀␀ˇˇWhoa!  Take the stupid chocolate.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee you later.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, Hopkins you psychotic gimp, this way.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy, follow me.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou attacked Eunice.␀␀ˇˇGary was knocked out.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou attacked Russell.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou attacked Russell's goon.␀␀ˇˇYou left the school hallways.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI hate that Constantinos guy even more than the nerds.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go to the caf... I'll show you the local wildlife.␀␀ˇˇLet's go to the caf, I'll show you who's who.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou should probably change into your uniform if you don't want to get in trouble. ␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's Russell's locker.  You know, the big ape who almost put you in the hospital.␀␀␀ˇˇDon't let the prefects see you break any rules.  They'll hurt you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're dead new kid, dead.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe took my chocolate... please get it back.␀␀␀ˇˇHave you got it yet?␀␀ˇˇSomeone stole my one-eyed elf and I need him for tonight's game.␀␀ˇˇDid you find him yet?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on, let's break into it and steal something.  That'll teach him.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDid you get the chocolate?␀␀␀␀ˇˇThanks... uhm... wanna make out?␀␀ˇˇRemember me?  You're dead!␀␀␀␀ˇˇHere we are... the boys dorm.  You'll learn to love it.␀␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGary␀␀ˇˇYou can fill up your balloons with water at any fountain or sink.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇStay inside and explore the school hallways.␀␀ˇˇOh man, there's that weird chick Eunice.  Let's have some fun with her.␀␀␀ˇˇGet the new kid!  Beat him down!␀␀ˇˇDid you get it?␀␀␀ˇˇYou.  New kid.  Money.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf I don't get that elf back I'll never hear the end of it from Algernon.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI really need that Elf for tonight's quest Jimmy.  We're going into the sewers!␀␀␀ˇˇThat's enough of that!  Break it up!␀␀ˇˇOoooh.  So you wanna scrap?␀␀␀ˇˇThere he is.  Show him what you're made of Jimmy.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAaaah! Gary!␀␀ˇˇYou actually kissed her?␀␀ˇˇOh my God, oh my God!!␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'll give you five bucks if you get it back for me.␀␀␀ˇˇHey you!  Break it up!␀␀␀␀ˇˇWe don't have a bar in the dorm, just a soda machine.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI have my eye on you new kid.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo.  See what she wants.␀␀ˇˇExplore the school with Gary.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCheck out the cafeteria.␀␀ˇˇBreak into Russell's locker.␀␀ˇˇTalk to Eunice.␀␀␀ˇˇGet Eunice's chocolates back for her.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPick up the chocolates.␀␀␀ˇˇReturn the chocolates to Eunice.␀␀ˇˇHide in the garbage bin to escape the prefect.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGuess what time it is?  Yep, time for a beatdown!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAhhh NOOO!␀␀␀␀ˇˇCould you get it back for me?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAw, come on.␀␀ˇˇWhy are you not in your uniform young man?  Go change immediately!␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing?␀␀␀ˇˇSure... I'll give you the chocolate, if you pay.␀␀ˇˇJimmy, this way.␀␀ˇˇOh no, not again.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI didn't want them anyway.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey ugly!  Where's the library?␀␀␀ˇˇThanks!  Now I'll be able to get level six and max out my mining skill.␀␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy, let me show you around this prison.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGreet Russell.␀␀␀␀ˇˇApologize to Russell.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPay off Russell.␀␀%˜1␀␀␀␀∆DT␀Y␀␀␀•Ió␀•␀␀␀Ç*ª␀Õ␀␀␀~l‹␀Ì␀␀␀¨z›␀␀␀Ô≠˝␀M␀␀5˛␀Y␀␀©Åˇ␀}␀␀ã∫•␀␀Nè!π␀␀KUCÈ␀␀§‡/␀␀!&
