␀␀¯␀␀?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMess them up with the slingshot.  Mr. Burton's sure to work them hard if they screw up their exercises.␀␀␀ˇˇIt's like I was hit by something!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAll right.␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on, let's go down to the football field␀␀ˇˇI didn't tell you to stop.␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on, can't you even break a little glass?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou!  With the slingshot!  I see you!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's not the way to do it you jerk.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAnd you know what, I bet you can distract them without getting caught.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWatch the jocks run a lap.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you?  Stupid?␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's pathetic.␀␀ˇˇI don't care!  Run a lap you sack of old pants.␀␀␀ˇˇHit the prefect.  Let's see what happens.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBut you don't understand, I just got hit.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhy are you stopping you damn slackers?␀␀␀ˇˇCan you hit them with the slingshot?␀␀ˇˇThe bullies are about to start practice with Mr. Burton.␀␀ˇˇGo hide in that tree so you can mess with them.␀␀␀ˇˇThat's not a bad shot.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm going to take a seat on the bleachers to watch the fun.␀␀␀ˇˇHey you!  What are you doing?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee those bottles?␀␀␀␀ˇˇI guess you don't suck.␀␀␀ˇˇYou do have some talent.␀␀ˇˇYou knocked out Mr. Burton.␀␀␀ˇˇShoot out the windows of the bus, Jimmy.␀␀ˇˇKnock the jocks out with your slingshot.␀␀ˇˇHide in a tree and wait for football practice.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFailed to get back into the tree.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet back into the tree.␀␀␀ˇˇShoot out the bus windows with your slingshot.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet back to shooting windows.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou used the wrong weapon to destroy the windows.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing you lazy guts?  Get going!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhy do you keep doing stupid things?␀␀ˇˇThe tree Jimmy.␀␀␀ˇˇYou gonna do it or what?␀␀ˇˇC'mon, let's go down to the football field.␀␀␀ˇˇJust awful.␀␀␀ˇˇHey, see if you can knock out the windows in that bus.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLook, it's Russell's goons.  They work out here with Burton after class.  He HATES it when they stop their drills though.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAre you blind or something?␀␀␀ˇˇSomeone's messing with us sir.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFollow Gary to the old school bus.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo to the football field.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou pissed off Gary. He is leaving.␀␀␀ˇˇGary was knocked out.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou were spotted.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGary␀␀ˇˇClimb the tree and wait for football practice.␀␀␀␀ˇˇUse the slingshot on them from a tree.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt was a rock, a rock hit me sir.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's not my fault!  Something hit me!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAre you slow or something?  Get in the tree.␀␀ˇˇI guess you are good at something.␀␀␀␀ˇˇBut Mr. Burton, something HIT me.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHere we are, and no prefects around.  Perfect.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat exactly are you aiming at?␀␀␀ˇˇThat's pathetic.  Run another lap and quit bitching.  Go!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMan you suck.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHahah - nice work.  I love watching people get brutalized.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou know what being lazy gets you?  It gets you another lap you lazy guts.␀␀␀␀ß␀␀␀␀)˜1␀m␀␀␀ñ7S␀ï␀␀␀¨≈u␀•␀␀␀≈
