␀␀¯␀␀?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt isn't halloween for real if no one throws a dead rat at a girl.  Will you do it Jimmy?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYumyumyumyumyumyumyumyum.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAlright, let's go to the teachers' lounge. You lead on.␀␀␀ˇˇHere ya go boy... How about a little trick for a treat?␀␀␀ˇˇTake this kick me note and stick it on the back of one of those nerds.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNo you look fine. Don't be a baby.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHa that was sort of funny.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStop whining, let's go.␀␀␀ˇˇOK, here's the plan... I'll light this bag of crap on fire.␀␀␀ˇˇStop playing with it, just catch it.␀␀ˇˇNo no, I look like a jerk.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI've been kicked in the balls, reported to the principal, and now you guys are messing around with dog crap?␀␀ˇˇDude, you suck.␀␀␀ˇˇItching powder is awesome.  I'll give you some if you use it on some loser.␀␀␀ˇˇThere... throw the rat at the fat girl.␀␀␀ˇˇGary␀␀ˇˇHehehe... it'd be totally funny if you threw some eggs at someone.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHa ha! Nice one, Jimmy.␀␀␀ˇˇOkay, get ready!␀␀ˇˇHey! What are you doing to Chester?␀␀␀ˇˇYou blew it Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGary, you're one disturbed individual.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI made some stinkbombs yesterday in chemistry class.  Would you field test my design?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI got this Volcano 4000 but I'm kinda scared to set it off.  Will you please do it?␀␀␀ˇˇFirst giant pink bunny rabbits, now this... what's happening to this school?␀␀ˇˇAh yes... The Volcano 4000, my favorite trick firework.␀␀␀ˇˇDon't worry, it'll be funny!␀␀ˇˇNice one loser.  See ya'.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWait for him to take a dump, and then...␀␀ˇˇThe cool thing about marbles is that people slip on them and almost break their necks.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm outta here!␀␀␀ˇˇRat versus Jimmy.. rat is winning.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWait for the alarm to stop.␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned the Red Ninja Costume.␀␀ˇˇPick up the bag.␀␀ˇˇLooks like the rat is smarter than you.␀␀␀ˇˇ"This sign says ""kick me"".  I'm sure you know what to do, right?"␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go get Pete.  I got him a real nice costume.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGuys I look like a jerk.␀␀ˇˇWhat the devil is going on out here?␀␀ˇˇWhatever, Pete. Ok, let's do this Jim. I'll explain the rest later.␀␀␀ˇˇGet over here you little mutt!␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's gross!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go find some of those pranks I smuggled onto campus earlier.␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh! God! Damn Kids!␀␀␀ˇˇ~x~ Skip␀␀ˇˇProtect Gary from Chad.␀␀␀ˇˇPull the fire alarm.␀␀ˇˇGary was knocked out.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou ruined the prank.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Drop bag␀␀ˇˇScore!␀␀␀␀ˇˇSorry Pete, there's no room  back here.␀␀␀ˇˇWhat... what the hell?␀␀␀␀ˇˇSet it off near those guys.␀␀␀ˇˇOkay, here's the deal. We're going to feed Chad's dog some of this rancid meat.␀␀␀ˇˇWell done.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHurry up... what, are you afraid of a little rat?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇShut up bitch.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHelp Gary with the dog.␀␀␀ˇˇHead to the teachers' lounge.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDrop the bag in the marked location.␀␀÷€␀␀␀␀˜¶0␀a␀␀␀å-1␀Å␀␀␀êÚ1␀Ω␀␀␀±R␀˘␀␀␀õ8S␀E␀␀%Éu␀m␀␀'≈u␀ç␀␀9éó␀©␀␀Uôò␀È␀␀1–∏␀␀␀dÂ€␀1␀␀s∂°␀␀í∫µ␀␀º,␀␀lìE1␀␀Òˇö9␀␀í…õÅ␀␀+Qúù␀␀¸¥·±␀␀—,Ÿ␀␀d≤Ò␀␀‚Ù␀␀îy␀␀ß&—␀␀àF!␀␀¢OG]␀␀œﬂH}␀␀ﬂÈjù␀␀kÏj…␀␀t0k%␀␀6bã9␀␀ó[J!a␀␀!ëE.Å␀␀Z25©␀␀k£è7Ω␀␀◊K¥7È␀␀ÂM¥71␀␀˝X÷7i␀␀kò÷7Ö␀␀ ¯7≠␀␀ól8ı␀␀*58␀␀õ3<8-␀␀}Ç8u␀␀Æà$>ç␀␀Ø–Aô␀␀µ–Aµ␀␀É˝©CÕ␀␀Ñ˝©CÈ␀␀vk8W	␀␀˛“cZ	␀␀ÂÄn	␀␀	Ì¢n)	␀␀0£nU	␀␀±}poq	␀␀±øpoë	␀␀ŸâqoÂ	␀␀@àíoı	␀␀‡Qìo-
