 poor boy.␀␀␀ˇˇWatch out Hopkins, I'm coming to teach you a lesson.␀␀ˇˇBlocking the door.  Not bad for an illbred moron like you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's right boys, teach him some manners.␀␀␀␀ˇˇMy turn.␀␀ˇˇGet that buffoon out of here.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDERBY␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDefeat Derby.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell...  I suppose I'll just have to give you a thrashing the old fashioned way.␀␀ˇˇYou pathetic wretch, hiding behind your friends.␀␀ˇˇI have had enough of this.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou guys soften him up, I'll get a drink.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThey just keep coming.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHold on Jimmy-boy.  You stay here.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Lower Bar␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGive me a hand in here boys!␀␀ˇˇI'm leveraging the assets I have and you don't.  Friends.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust shut up Derby.␀␀␀ˇˇIt's called tactics dear boy, something you might grasp one day.␀␀ˇˇDo try not to get any blood on the furniture.␀␀␀␀␀¿U␀␀␀␀Œòπ␀5␀␀␀,‹␀e␀␀␀6›␀ù␀␀␀2Ñ ›␀␀␀ycD␀␀è0.␀␀`^,=␀␀`^,I␀␀	Æê7]␀␀mô˜7±␀␀∞Ù8Â␀␀qh;8␀␀ìu]85␀␀”	_8Q␀␀∑	ay␀␀␀Änç␀␀ﬁŒÁn≠␀␀å€ËnÌ␀␀Ú÷ìo␀␀'∂oI␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀4Õ´␀␀␀␀␀␀␀§␀␀8␀␀'␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThanks for a great date Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇObviously she's afraid of real men like us.  Hahaha.␀␀ˇˇWhere are you going Jimmy?  You never got me my teddy bear.␀␀␀ˇˇCome on!␀␀ˇˇWhat's she doing with that puny dork.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go pick up the bear now!␀␀␀␀ˇˇCheck out the chump.␀␀ˇˇHah... look... it's Jimmy Jenkins... Hopkins whatever his name is..␀␀␀ˇˇThis was so exciting, I love when the carnival comes to town.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're quite a piece of work Pinky.␀␀␀ˇˇOh no... daddy won't let me work.  I'm to marry someone of my own social class.␀␀␀ˇˇHey no problem.␀␀␀ˇˇYou people... you're just so... so... real.  Poverty is very romantic I think.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy.  Glad to see you're on time, unlike some of my other dates.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou need prize tickets.␀␀␀ˇˇMeet up with Pinky at Billy Crane's Travelling Carnival.␀␀ˇˇWin tickets by playing the carnival games.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPurchase a bear from the prize tent.␀␀ˇˇGive the bear to Pinky.␀␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're leaving?  Fine.  So am I.  Jerk.␀␀␀ˇˇHey wait up!␀␀ˇˇThanks Jimmy.  It's so cute.␀␀ˇˇOh cool!␀␀ˇˇWhere is that crazy chick?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHow much for the bear?␀␀␀␀ˇˇPinky now likes you.␀␀ˇˇYou need some flowers.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWin prize tickets by playing the games in the carnival.␀␀␀ˇˇSee ya' later wimp.␀␀␀ˇˇYou know... I've always been strangely attracted to the socially disadvantaged, Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are we waiting for, let's go have some fun.␀␀ˇˇYou'll win me a teddy bear won't you Jimmy?  I'm easily swayed by presents you know.␀␀ˇˇPinky was attacked.␀␀␀ˇˇThe carnival has closed.␀␀ˇˇPinky got bored of waiting for you.␀␀␀ˇˇYou abandoned Pinky at the carnival.␀␀ˇˇPinky was knocked out.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou can buy flowers at the market. Look for the ~genstore~ on the world map.␀␀8M␀␀␀␀:ê␀%␀␀␀πJv␀]␀␀␀‡ôò␀ù␀␀␀U‹π␀©␀␀␀gÊ€␀’␀␀␀5Ñˇ␀˘␀␀␀™äB␀␀≈,Y␀␀Õ#øù␀␀÷n≈␀␀#Xi␀␀`q≠-␀␀}|ÆÅ␀␀sΩœÕ␀␀CÌ—(È␀␀DÌ—(%␀␀EÌ—(U␀␀FÌ—(}␀␀ ®1ô␀␀Í⁄˜7°␀␀468Õ␀␀º78›␀␀•˙<8˝␀␀*˚<8	␀␀A@=8)␀␀#J9E␀␀ˇ*‰i]␀␀®ÄÌly␀␀$Ånµ␀␀ì0ƒnÕ␀␀(o)␀␀µoo]␀␀w!ÿqµ␀␀x!ÿqÕ␀␀y!ÿqÈ␀␀z!ÿq␀␀{!ÿq9␀␀òÃyU␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀