uined for this.␀␀ˇˇThey're in my yard, destroying everything.  Catch them.␀␀␀ˇˇThis is an outrage!␀␀␀ˇˇAre you stooges incompetent?␀␀ˇˇYou!  What is the meaning of this?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHurry up and catch the little beggar.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou were caught by Mr. Hattrick.␀␀ˇˇDon't attack Mr. Hattrick's car.␀␀ˇˇYou lost Mr. Hattrick's car.␀␀ˇˇYou left Mr. Hattrick's property.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSomeone is going to pay for this!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI have done nothing to deserve this!␀␀ˇˇObjects such as potted plants and windows count towards vandalism.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet back in there and finish the job.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDestructo-meter␀␀␀ˇˇTravel to the school~n~parking lot.␀␀␀ˇˇFollow Mr. Hattrick's car to his home.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDestroy as much as you can around Mr. Hattrick's house.␀␀␀ˇˇGet out of Mr. Hattrick's yard.␀␀␀ˇˇGet onto Mr. Hattrick's property.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhy haven't you caught him yet?␀␀␀ˇˇYou!  What are you doing in my yard?␀␀{nR␀␀␀␀+@T␀1␀␀␀ºLó␀i␀␀␀iúò␀µ␀␀␀`∫␀Ì␀␀␀÷_€␀%␀␀x˛␀a␀␀Áü,y␀␀Œ"øô␀␀b´‡¡␀␀VÅ3Ì␀␀WÅ3␀␀XÅ35␀␀YÅ3U␀␀+y≤7}␀␀L∆≥7•␀␀çj=Õ␀␀éj=␀␀êj=A␀␀`‚yJU␀␀a‚yJ}␀␀b‚yJ©␀␀c‚yJÂ␀␀d‚yJ	␀␀ÚŸ	o1␀␀£
