ople... and don't you forget it.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet that ogre!  Slay him.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's just... stupid!␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou run like my crippled granma.␀␀ˇˇWhat?  You forgot your plus-speedy-boots or whatever?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt wasn't me... and... I'm not ugly!␀␀ˇˇAlmost caught me.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇToo slow, you lose.␀␀␀ˇˇI'll aid you in your battle against evil!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBetrayed!  Vanquished!  Defeated!  Thou art Brutus!␀␀␀ˇˇOh... come onnnn!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHaha!  Walk much?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMelvin was knocked out.␀␀␀ˇˇStop that!␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou recovered my precious documents.  Thank you sir, you are a noble man indeed.␀␀ˇˇSee ya'!␀␀ˇˇMaybe, but I go first!␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's cheating.␀␀ˇˇWho did that?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAll right, I'll give it to you if you beat my friend in a little game.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHow do you like them marbles?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThanks Melvin, but I think I will.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee you later, sucker.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGot "Gwythien The Elf Princess".␀␀ˇˇGot "Kedayth The Light Bearer".␀␀␀ˇˇGot "Jeroba Watcher of the Earth".␀␀␀␀ˇˇGot "Eowoama Goddess of Rebirth".␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGot "Qiath The Engima".␀␀␀ˇˇRecover Melvin's lost Character Sheets.␀␀␀ˇˇReturn the sheets to Melvin.␀␀ˇˇSome hero you are.  Come on, I'm right here.␀␀ˇˇAll right, you've got something of Melvin's.  Give it up.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm done running.  Now I beat you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPlease help us Jimmy!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou won't miss this.  You can always reroll.␀␀ˇˇWhat game?␀␀␀␀ˇˇEat marbles, nerd-lover!␀␀ˇˇThere's no such thing as magic, dweeb.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHere, I brought you a drink!␀␀ˇˇI didn't know you played nerd-games Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe kicks you in the nuts. Then you kick him in the nuts, until one of you gives up. If you win, you get the sheet. If not, we keep it.␀␀␀␀Ë␀␀␀␀ÛR␀5␀␀␀Çñ␀Ö␀␀␀Rò␀ù␀␀␀\ôò␀—␀␀␀lúò␀␀␀⁄_∫␀9␀␀ÍÂ∫␀q␀␀+ª␀ï␀␀Èb€␀’␀␀Í'‹␀␀␀v˛␀1␀␀π˛␀U␀␀ò˚˛␀y␀␀†˝˛␀°␀␀2ƒˇ␀Ω␀␀5∆ È␀␀µI!␀␀≤ÕBA␀␀SWCi␀␀ÊDç␀␀án•␀␀àn—␀␀ân˘␀␀än%␀␀ãnQ␀␀Üõq␀␀—#øë␀␀’eø¡␀␀˛¯Â␀␀Ïz$=␀␀ò F]␀␀®Gy␀␀w/kù␀␀d.åŸ␀␀bpå␀␀‹±≠␀␀á}Æ1␀␀òØa␀␀õ»Øô␀␀a∫œ±␀␀l€!…␀␀#Ûê7Â␀␀™xë7ı␀␀5≤7I␀␀UK¥7U␀␀]L¥7q␀␀]M¥7Ö␀␀{§