the Candy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhoa... I'm... feeling a little light... headed.␀␀ˇˇI think so... let's go check.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's get out of here!␀␀␀␀ˇˇI mean, kids are so silly, I hate most of them, the obnoxious little brats.␀␀␀ˇˇHey... is that Dr. Watts? With Edna?␀␀ˇˇAre you... like... coming up with biological experiments for the school food?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUhm... yeah... ah... sounds like you've... ah... given it some thought.␀␀␀ˇˇCouldn't mistake her anywhere...  who's she with?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm having a lot of difficulty sleeping because of this problem.␀␀ˇˇMr. Bucket had to go to a dentist convention.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt seems a student has been leaving muffins in my class room when I'm not there␀␀␀ˇˇCome on!␀␀ˇˇEdna, you really do look...  smashing tonight.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm outta here.␀␀␀ˇˇHahah! Can you imagine if they did?  Like if they made a mold golem or something?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOw!  Let's get out of here.␀␀␀ˇˇSo it is.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat was that?  Let's go!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOhmigod Edna, I'm so sorry.¬† Did you like cut your face when you shaved or something?␀␀␀␀ˇˇAnyways, I must get back to my lab.␀␀␀ˇˇHello Dr. Watts.  Hello Edna.  Lovely day isn't it?␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you guys doing here?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh my dear doctor... I am very passionate in my love of chemistry.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAll right, here's your money you bastard.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't worry about it... it's probably nothing.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYeah, that's probably it.  Have some more coffee.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇReturn the items to Edna.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh great... I have something to talk to him about.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet Edna's items.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo back and protect Edna's date.␀␀ˇˇGot the Sedatives.␀␀␀␀ˇˇKeep students from ruining Edna's date.␀␀␀ˇˇIt's all I think about when I'm cooking away in my kitchen.␀␀␀ˇˇOh look over there!␀␀␀ˇˇLay off the sweet doubloons!␀␀ˇˇMust be... the fumes... from the... lab.␀␀ˇˇWhat the!? Let's go.␀␀ˇˇI'm scared! Let's get out of here, Algie!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇA blue car!␀␀␀ˇˇYou're like totally addicted huh?  Well... I've got some candy, but you'll have to pay for it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAh! There you are. About time.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're undermining the market economy with your lawless behavior.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇEdna, what are you doing?¬† You stink like cheap perfume... like did you drink a whole bottle or something?␀␀␀ˇˇThe food?  Well... it certainly is nothing like your cooking.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAhh, it's so great to finally be out of the kitchen!␀␀ˇˇA date?␀␀␀ˇˇGet out of here you little brats, before I get my cleaver␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat the hell is your problem?  Are you jealous of us?␀␀␀␀ˇˇAh, the foolish infatuations of youth.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDid I ever tell you how much I admire your lab coat Dr. Watts?␀␀␀␀ˇˇYeah, you're a scientist, you should be able to help us eat right... right?␀␀␀ˇˇGot the Perfume.␀␀ˇˇGet the perfume from the staff room.␀␀ˇˇGet the teachers away from the staff room.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet some candy.␀␀␀ˇˇGet some sedatives.␀␀␀ˇˇGet back to Edna.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDo not disturb the date. Hide in the tree.␀␀␀␀ˇˇKeep students from disturbing the date.␀␀␀ˇˇYou have hit the teachers.␀␀␀␀ˇˇMeet Edna at the Chez Louis caf√© in the Rich Area between 3PM and 10PM.␀␀ˇˇYou attacked Edna.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou did not hide in the tree in time.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet back on the branch.␀␀␀ˇˇYou already have chocolates. Get the rest of Edna's items.␀␀␀␀ˇˇEdna's items: ~i~/~i~␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRummage through the garbage for some sedatives.␀␀␀ˇˇGet the rest of the Edna's items.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe students disturbed the date.␀␀ˇˇHahaha!  I know... I've spent many years slaving away to get this good.␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing here Hopkins?  Get out!␀␀␀␀ˇˇDammit, I need some candy NOW!␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh hi Edna!␀␀␀ˇˇYou know Edna, I was quite surprised when you asked me to have coffee with you.␀␀␀ˇˇthe beads of sweat on your forehead and the way your lab coat clings ever so snugly to your backside.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo could you please explain to me what I did wrong?␀␀␀ˇˇHow'd you get Dr. Watts to go out with you Edna?¬† Like did you drug him?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAnyways, Edna, maybe you could give some recipes to my mom some time?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHahaha! That'd be so cool. It'd like shoot slime bolts out of its eyes. It'd be awesome!␀␀ˇˇHey Edna, you know I really love the food you cook.␀␀␀ˇˇOh yes.  I mean no.  I mean... it's obvious isn't it.  Uhm....␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's so tasty, and I think I've gained 25 pounds of pure muscle since I started eating it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI never knew you were interested in chemistry.␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh yes.  Me too.  I imagine they'd be constantly thinking about your bald head, ␀␀ˇˇLike I said, I only got an A and I always get an A+.␀␀ˇˇChild!  Leave.  Now!␀␀ˇˇAwful you say?  Why you... ah... I mean... I don't know who it could be.  Hahaha... ␀␀ˇˇI've seen those before.␀␀␀ˇˇYour mom still cooks for you?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLook, it's Dr. Watts.␀␀␀␀␀Hë␀␀␀␀ﬂY␀e␀␀␀Û"␀â␀␀␀Eò/␀—␀␀␀˙ß0␀›␀␀␀Äm1␀	␀␀ñ≤1␀%␀␀kkR␀U␀␀˘ØR␀Ö␀␀6S␀©␀␀˛t␀Ω␀␀ö?u␀Ò␀␀µÖu␀U␀␀¬éó␀ô␀␀Ùﬂò␀±␀␀˘Ê∫␀›␀␀^¢€␀Ì␀␀^Â€␀I␀␀˝˛␀≠␀␀"˝˛␀—␀␀¢!˝␀␀Y")␀␀±åBç␀␀ŒUC›␀␀f#-␀␀#3.!␀␀<’A]␀␀…õq␀␀&Pú•␀␀≥îú…␀␀;ïúÂ␀␀!QΩ5␀␀–eø]␀␀ÿfø±␀␀g´‡˝␀␀b.·5␀␀Íıy␀␀ñ≠␀␀ú␀␀≤H␀␀Ë8$A␀␀mº$U␀␀ˆΩ$≠␀␀"â%Õ␀␀®O&›␀␀ìMG˝␀␀ƒ!jY	␀␀}0kÅ	␀␀x8çπ	␀␀}ç›	␀␀í}ç%
