ume, my lipstick, even my laundry.␀␀␀ˇˇEverything. Now I've got nothing. I don't have much money.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's too bad.␀␀␀ˇˇMaybe you could get them back for me?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou want me to steal your stuff back from a bloodthirsty mob of angry greaseballs?␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'd be very grateful, Jimmy. Very grateful.␀␀␀H8␀␀␀H8␀␀␀H8)␀␀␀H8i␀␀␀H8ë␀␀␀H8Â␀␀␀H8˘␀␀␀	H8=␀␀
