d, I'm getting tired.  Give me a minute to catch my breath.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGuys! They're over here!␀␀ˇˇAlgie, you're in soooo much trouble with Johnny Vincent and his boys.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIs that Algie.... On a girl's bike?␀␀␀ˇˇGood job Jimmy... you do have your uses after all.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWatch out!␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on!  We know you know where he is.␀␀␀ˇˇYeah I believe you, but Johnny's not quite so reasonable.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh wonderful! You found him!␀␀ˇˇAnyways, you're in luck.  Earnest sent me to get you out of here.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell, thanks for all the help Jimmy. Perhaps you could come over to the observatory and play a game or two of Grottos and Gremlins with us sometime?␀␀ˇˇI was hoping you'd say that␀␀␀ˇˇWe've been building this Jimmy.  You might find it useful.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAlgie␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're not getting away with this, I'm getting Johnny!␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm outta here!␀␀␀ˇˇWhere is Algie, you walking beanpole?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou guys, take care of this pathetic excuse for a human being.␀␀␀␀ˇˇShut up Gary.  You guys get Algie and bring him to me at the clubhouse.␀␀␀ˇˇOh thanks so much Jimmy. Hey. I was lying when I told Johnny that Algie is at the pizza parlor. You've got to go help him!␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's a trap!  It's a trap!␀␀␀␀ˇˇWould it help if I got off and pushed?␀␀␀␀ˇˇWe're nearly there Jimmy, just hold them off a little longer.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCornelius was knocked out.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAlgie was knocked out.␀␀␀␀ˇˇEarnest was knocked out.␀␀ˇˇYou attacked the nerds.␀␀␀ˇˇChad␀␀ˇˇCornelius␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect -15␀␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect +5␀␀␀ˇˇHelp meee! Please! Anybody!␀␀␀ˇˇThere they are, on those bikes!␀␀␀ˇˇOh damn.␀␀ˇˇDon't worry about it, but we should get back to the library.␀␀ˇˇYOU!!!␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat? Well he's gotta be around here somewhere. Lets go find him␀␀ˇˇGet lost!  This ain't none of your business!␀␀ˇˇI found them guys!  They're over here.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe's at the pizza parlor, ok? Please let me go now...␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou guys, you take care of these two losers.␀␀ˇˇHere they come - I'll hold them off, just try not to crash into anything, Chad.␀␀␀ˇˇI told you he knew where Algie was.␀␀␀ˇˇOne down!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI think we've lost them.␀␀ˇˇLook around for Cornelius.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDefend Cornelius from the greasers.␀␀␀ˇˇTravel to Algie in New Coventry.␀␀ˇˇHold off the greasers.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake Algie to Earnest.␀␀␀␀`ÁQ␀␀␀␀Û+R␀␀␀␀Äñ␀u␀␀␀€öπ␀ï␀␀␀m£∫␀•␀␀␀t≠‹␀µ␀␀␀∆»ˇ␀·␀␀␀Ä˘-␀␀ë> q␀␀yõç␀␀&’ΩŸ␀␀S%‡␀␀s1·9␀␀Ü;I␀␀¶&u␀␀0Q&µ␀␀·©j’␀␀oıå␀␀ÒyÆµ␀␀Ø’␀␀<·^␀␀‚@74!␀␀”¥7)␀␀:’7e␀␀¬’7y␀␀˜ö÷7•␀␀Â8È␀␀|b85␀␀<IÄ8µ␀␀␀‰£8’␀␀éi§8␀␀O¬z:E␀␀P¬z:e␀␀Q¬z:Å␀␀R¬z:ù␀␀xó6aπ␀␀tu8a¡␀␀:‘Kn—␀␀=‘KnÈ␀␀ç£Än˝␀␀˚$¢n␀␀-4£nA␀␀*∂£nM␀␀B?≈nç␀␀»∆nô␀␀/¿Ên›␀␀›	o␀␀Ìù+o9␀␀¨,ou␀␀™s-o•␀␀EOo˘␀␀¥Cío!	␀␀YQ¥o1	␀␀étqM	␀␀étqm	␀␀étqï	␀␀étqπ	␀␀étq’	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀4Õ´␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀&␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇuhm.. ah... taking out the trash?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ... I just love wrecking things with my hammer.␀␀␀ˇˇUse Norton's hammer to get some of Lola's items.␀␀ˇˇYou got Lola's Lipstick.␀␀ˇˇReturn the items to Lola.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNor