ˇAll right, get ready.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey kid... just so you know, there are more races coming up.␀␀ˇˇStage 2 Race unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStage 3 Race unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStage 4 Race unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStage 5 Race unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStage 6 Race unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStage 7 Race unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Academy Race complete.␀␀ˇˇBullworth Town Races complete.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSure.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome to do some racing?␀␀␀ˇˇWhen are these races?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOK cool␀␀␀ˇˇGood luck.  You'll need it...␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNew Coventry Races complete.␀␀ˇˇBike Helmet and Jersey unlocked.␀␀ˇˇJust meet the other racers after school, in the alley behind the boxing ring.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust meet the other racers after school, in the alley behind the theater.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust meet the other racers after school, in the alley by the junk yard.␀␀␀ˇˇJust meet the other racers after school, in the school parking lot.␀␀␀ˇˇSo you think you've got a few more races in you huh?␀␀ˇˇWell, you've come to the right place.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust put your name down on this list.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSince you only have one win, you'll have to compete in this neighborhood.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe more races you win, the more neighborhoods you can race in.␀␀␀ˇˇJust meet the other racers after school, in the alley behind the boxing ring.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRacing league␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOld Bullworth Vale␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Town␀␀␀␀ˇˇNew Coventry␀␀ˇˇSchool grounds␀␀␀␀ˇˇEvery night.  Just sign up before hand.␀␀␀ˇˇYou ready to race?␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe winner is James Hopkins!␀␀ˇˇYou here for the race?␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh yeah?␀␀ˇˇHey, there are races every night if you're interested, sign up sheet's outside.␀␀␀ˇˇCan I help you with anything?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhich course would you like to race on this time?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Races complete.␀␀␀␀· 0␀␀␀␀±1␀␀␀␀ìÛ1␀=␀␀␀¢ı1␀Q␀␀␀–—!i␀␀␀—␀Å␀␀␀À]æô␀␀␀Vo±␀␀␀›␀␀␀µH˘␀␀␀å¬j"9␀␀ç¬j"U␀␀é¬j"q␀␀è¬j"ç␀␀ê¬j"©␀␀ë¬j"≈␀␀pŒµ2·␀␀)ÿµ2␀␀mê7)␀␀´wë75␀␀ÁW˜7Q␀␀Ô;8m␀␀;y␀␀¡q;ù␀␀Ë∆´\Ω␀␀3¬ı\·␀␀4¬ı\5␀␀5¬ı\Ö␀␀6¬ı\—␀␀æy˝\␀␀øy˝\Q␀␀¿y˝\}␀␀¡y˝\©␀␀¬y˝\˘␀␀√y˝\=␀␀øÕDkë␀␀»Ek•␀␀…EkΩ␀␀ Ek—␀␀ÀEk·␀␀~&¢nı␀␀†∂ƒn!␀␀.˙ƒn9␀␀3