␀␀ÿ␀␀;␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey!  Only athletes are allowed in here.␀␀ˇˇHmm... maybe I can use this to my advantage.␀␀ˇˇThanks.  I'll be sure to visit you often.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat, war footage and natural disasters doesn't do it for you?␀␀␀␀ˇˇEnough talking. Let's fight.␀␀ˇˇWhy not, I can always use this place to crash.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's a pretty cool game... it's all about killing things and taking their stuff.␀␀ˇˇLet's.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI always said I'd give my bottle rocket launcher to whoever beat Fatty's high score.  Here, take it.␀␀ˇˇNever! Malker the Brute will never allow it!␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing here? You can't join our party.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat was it called?  Grottos and Gremlins or something like that?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhatever.  I'm better than any of you losers.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDude, that's my sister you're talking about.␀␀ˇˇOK you won.  I guess you can use the clubhouse.␀␀␀ˇˇGet back to the nerd hangout.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThis sucks.  There's never anything good on TV.␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's going on sir?␀␀ˇˇOh yeah?  How about we beat you in a game of dodgeball?␀␀␀ˇˇBeat Fatty's ConSumo high score of 1,010 lbs.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou lost the tournament.␀␀ˇˇYou left the club meeting.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou guys having fun?␀␀ˇˇI want you gone.  Get lost.␀␀␀ˇˇSounds good, how about you introduce me some time?␀␀␀␀ˇˇAlright, I won.  Give me my prize.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNo no no! You can't use diplomacy to make the elf princess do that.␀␀␀ˇˇHey!  What are you doing here?␀␀␀␀ˇˇ... man she was nice looking.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm here to beat you up and evict you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGive him a chance.  Let him join if he can beat Fatty's ConSumo high score.␀␀␀ˇˇNice place you guys have found.  I think I'll take it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet rid of all the Greasers.␀␀ˇˇGet rid of all the Preppies.␀␀ˇˇGet rid of all the Jocks.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet rid of all the Dropouts.␀␀ˇˇYou've got a new hideout.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNew Save Location~n~unlocked.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet rid of all the Nerds.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned~n~the Townie's Hangout.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned~n~the Greaser Hangout.␀␀ˇˇYou've earned~n~the Jock Clubhouse.␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned~n~the Nerd Clubhouse.␀