o of the prep selling tests.␀␀ˇˇTo get more evidence, go to the school gym.␀␀␀ˇˇHide in the pool stands.␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the prep and jock together.␀␀␀ˇˇFollow the prep.␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the prep and Mr. Hattrick together.␀␀␀ˇˇReturn the photos to Mr. Galloway.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's this?␀␀ˇˇYeah, do you have the tests?␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee you at midterms.␀␀ˇˇWhat are you looking at peon?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou know he drinks on school grounds.  Think of the children, Dr. Crabblesnitch.␀␀ˇˇAlright, I'll pay.  You drive a hard bargain.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBut I... I... I... Oh.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI sure hope he shows up. I need to get my grade up.␀␀␀ˇˇDo you have my cash?␀␀ˇˇYes I am.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat?  You took pictures?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThanks for the cash chaps.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGreetings.  Did you chaps bring the money?␀␀␀␀ˇˇDrinking?  I will terminate the employment contract of any staff member found corrupting children.  Morality is the most important lesson we can teach the youth.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's that fat, evil hypocrite selling test answers to rich kids.  Fire him!␀␀␀ˇˇI have the pictures and a copy of the test sir.  Seems Hattrick's selling tests to almost everyone.␀␀␀ˇˇYou didn't get any pictures Jimmy? Oh.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThere you are sir.␀␀␀␀ˇˇMoney money!  Hahahaha!␀␀␀ˇˇWhy do we need these tests? I just copy my work from you guys.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou didn't take the picture in time.␀␀ˇˇYou were spotted.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou attacked Mr. Galloway.␀␀␀␀Ån1␀␀␀␀§Çu␀␀␀␀¨π␀5␀␀␀Ë'‹␀m␀␀␀ˆl˝␀ï␀␀␀w˛␀π␀␀␀(˛˛␀›␀␀␀Uê!␀␀€òC%␀␀Ó-y␀␀#õﬂù␀␀d≥¡␀␀ %Ò␀␀£”G)␀␀ HU␀␀Lßãç␀␀^p≠µ␀␀g≥≠›␀␀µ´1␀␀∂´1=␀␀∑´1q␀␀∏´1°␀␀π´1Ω␀␀∫´1Ì␀␀ª´1␀␀º´19␀␀êê7a␀␀"∫≤7q␀␀,ÔÚ7ë␀␀Æ8ô␀␀$∫]8±␀␀±Ä^8’␀␀‹L_8)␀␀Êé_8]␀␀€ïny␀␀p⁄n±␀␀£1£n…␀␀Ü.ƒnŸ␀␀DÅ≈n˘␀␀M√≈n␀␀[ŒÁnI␀␀(2-oÒ␀␀˘fMoA␀␀FOo©␀␀8po’␀␀c÷¥oÌ␀␀iZµo	␀␀È@±zM␀␀Í@±zu␀␀Î@±zç␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀