rom the Watcher?␀␀ˇˇMan, the last thing we need is some sort of  Watcher stampede again.␀␀ˇˇAlright, back to your rooms!␀␀ˇˇI think I'll just follow you for a while.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't worry Miss.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy!  I'm glad you made it.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGally-bear?␀␀␀ˇˇAre you off to the Blaydon races?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing?␀␀␀ˇˇHey... wanna buy some Nigerian yellow cake?␀␀␀ˇˇAlarm!  Alarm!  They're breaking out!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet back in there.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's that commotion?␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't let the orderlies spot you or you'll be thrown off the property.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTravel to the asylum.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSneak through the asylum and find Mr.Galloway.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFind a back way out of the asylum.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFind a way onto the asylum grounds.␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Lower the Ladder␀␀ˇˇGet inside the asylum without being spotted.␀␀ˇˇEscape the asylum.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDestroy the statue's power source without being seen.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMeet Ms. Philips near the asylum.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're supposed to be sneaky.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMe too.  I'm so happy to have my Gally-bear back.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's going on over there?␀␀␀ˇˇIt's the patients' 'outside time'... get them some fresh air and all that.  Now run along.␀␀␀␀ˇˇVery well sir... please follow me to the front desk.␀␀ˇˇFlee!  Flee to save your souls!␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you talking about?␀␀␀ˇˇI'll just follow you around because I'm crazy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPlease hurry... and try to talk some sense in to him.  I'll be waiting for him at the asylum gates.␀␀␀ˇˇGet going... go go go.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTravel to the observatory tunnels.␀␀␀␀˘ß0␀␀␀␀{,R␀-␀␀␀oR␀Q␀␀␀êyt␀y␀␀␀Mòπ␀ï␀␀␀`›π␀Ω␀␀␀–óC’␀␀␀Œú,Â␀␀␀£3.␀␀‘ΩI␀␀M^æa␀␀M#øq␀␀≤úﬂï␀␀ÍÌ‡˘␀␀}¯)␀␀||]␀␀≤ë&ç␀␀/QG’␀␀Â„H␀␀Ω j=␀␀Vßjm␀␀Ö¯åÖ␀␀éu≤7©␀␀}ö÷7π␀␀`ò˜7·␀␀˜¯7˘␀␀É¨;8)␀␀ˆ£8U␀␀w„£8m␀␀d““;â␀␀GG;F’␀␀ÕG;FÒ␀␀“H;F%␀␀›J;FM␀␀‡K;Fu␀␀·K;Fç␀␀‚K;FΩ␀␀„K;F’␀␀…€KQ␀␀wà\9␀␀∑~≈n]␀␀QÕoï␀␀⁄	oµ␀␀›î	o␀␀o
