is so cool!␀␀ˇˇOh crap, there he is.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe jocks totally respect me when I'm the mascot.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUp here suckers!␀␀ˇˇLooking good ladies, looking good! Can I practice with you some time?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThis is getting scary.␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on guys, you can get me in can't you?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey guys!  Where'd you go?␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm getting maaaad!␀␀␀ˇˇYeah... if they let you in.␀␀␀ˇˇLet's go toss those girls off the roof.␀␀␀ˇˇJock Respect -5␀␀␀ˇˇYou're messing with the wrong mascot!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇStop that!␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhy does everyone always beat the mascot?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'm gonna maim you.␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing to our whipping-boy?␀␀␀ˇˇHaha!  Nerds on the rampage!␀␀ˇˇWhoa!  What's all this?␀␀␀ˇˇYou've got to be kidding me.  Nerds?␀␀ˇˇCome on then!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFire at will!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNerds?!  What the?!␀␀␀ˇˇYou are so annoying!␀␀ˇˇHey guys... see you at the party tonight?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHaha you sucker!␀␀ˇˇYou can't beat him!  That's our job!␀␀ˇˇHaha... of course.  You're the mascot.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou... defeated... the... mascot.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo team go!␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned the Mascot Outfit.␀␀ˇˇTravel to the football field and annoy the mascot.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLead the mascot to the pool.␀␀ˇˇEnter the pool area and find the mascot.␀␀ˇˇDefeat the mascot.␀␀␀␀ˇˇActivate bull power!␀␀ˇˇHey man, leave the Bullworth Bull alone!␀␀ˇˇLooking good dude!␀␀␀␀ˇˇMan... You shouldn't have touched the Bull!␀␀␀ˇˇHey!  Don't touch the mascot!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's up man?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHell yeah!␀␀␀␀ˇˇHelp me guys, Jimmy's being a jerk!␀␀␀ˇˇIt's kinda stuffy in here.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's your problem kid?  You've been following me all day.␀␀␀ˇˇI hate you Hopkins!␀␀␀ˇˇGo for the eyes!␀␀ˇˇOk thanks... see ya'␀␀ˇˇ... right in the family jewels.  It was awesome!␀␀ˇˇI'm gonna pummel you...␀␀␀ˇˇHelp!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNice dance... my school spirit has increased significantly.␀␀␀ˇˇSee ya'... good luck at the game.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMascot␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~x~ Skip␀␀ˇˇGet back to the football field.␀␀␀ˇˇI can't get through.␀␀ˇˇHey, can you hook me up with Mandy?␀␀␀ˇˇYou're such a buttwipe.␀␀␀ˇˇI've got the strength of a bull man.  Back off!␀␀␀ˇˇSometimes ya' just gotta take the bull by the horns.␀␀ˇˇ... and now you pay the price.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't mess with the mascot, man.␀␀ˇˇThis suit needs air conditioning.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo are any of you hotties single?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWatch out!  It's nerd fighters!␀␀␀ˇˇMan... you're so cool.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet him!␀␀ˇˇOk... I'm going to do it.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLeave me alone jerk.␀␀ˇˇThe mascot got away.␀␀ˇˇYou ruined the mascot's outfit.␀␀␀≠L␀␀␀␀;ê␀␀␀␀ﬁY␀Q␀␀␀®␀ï␀␀␀ﬁ0␀µ␀␀␀
