␀␀ˇˇYou'll dance for me, won't you?␀␀␀ˇˇYeah boy. You sure can dance.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGuys!  The mascot boy's screwing up again.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat the hell are you girls doing?␀␀␀␀ˇˇAgent Bull, before I give you any sensitive information I must ask you for the secret password.␀␀␀ˇˇYou guys are a bunch of no good weak wristed damn wimps!␀␀ˇˇYou suck.  I'm gonna kick your ass.␀␀␀ˇˇYou!  Mascot boy!  Get the hell offa my field.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWork your asses off, boys.  I gotta reprogram the scoreboard.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou better get better real quick.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOnly jocks beat the bull!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe football game will be good, but not as good as a wrestling match.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYour quest, young Jimmy is perilous but the rewards are glorious.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThere's a rumor that someone is going to screw up the game.␀␀␀ˇˇThanks Bucky.  Now get lost.␀␀ˇˇYeah.  I got it.␀␀ˇˇIs it, quit messing around before I lose my patience and hurt you?␀␀␀␀ˇˇDance for me boy!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou should come this way␀␀ˇˇCome on, you can do it.␀␀␀ˇˇYu-uck! Like sicky yu-UCK!␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on!  Dance!␀␀ˇˇGo to the school gym.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇEnhance the jock's sports drink.␀␀ˇˇSports drink enhanced.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLeave the school gym.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSwap the game ball with the rigged ball.␀␀ˇˇYou lost the rigged ball.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPick up the game ball.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPut the rigged ball in the bag.␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Hack the Scoreboard␀␀␀ˇˇDance in front of Thad to unlock the gates.␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~t~ to plant the rigged ball.␀␀␀ˇˇJock Respect -15␀␀ˇˇGlue the player's benches.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Glue the Bench␀␀␀␀ˇˇBench Glued.␀␀ˇˇSpread marbles on the football field.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet more marbles from Melvin's stash behind the bleachers.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHack the scoreboard.␀␀ˇˇOperation trojan cow complete.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTalk to nerd agents.␀␀ˇˇDo the Cow Dance.~n~ ~n~Hold ~L1~ and press ~x~.␀␀ˇˇYou attacked the nerds.␀␀␀ˇˇTalk to the nerd agent.␀␀␀ˇˇGet back to the school grounds.␀␀␀ˇˇObjective Complete␀␀␀␀ˇˇTalk to the final nerd agent.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDo your dance mascot!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLets go get something to drink.␀␀␀ˇˇScatter them over the football field.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's totally grody!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBe careful out there my brave bull.␀␀␀ˇˇIt'll change the text of the scoreboard. I re-programmed it. You'll like it. The jocks won't.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGod. And to imagine, you don't even get paid for this.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNice.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't get caught with your pants down!␀␀␀␀ˇˇPlease dance for me.!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're in grave danger of a knuckle sandwich if you don't get on with it, that's what.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHere's a ball we've rigged.  Get to the shed by the field and swap it for the real game ball.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCould you like get out of our locker room?␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou still any good mascot?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHahaha. Man. I'm so glad I'm not you.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYeay school spirit!␀␀␀ˇˇGet the dog away from the bag so you can access it safely.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThis is too much for me.␀␀ˇˇThat's what I'm talking about.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're so dorky.  I love it.␀␀ˇˇYou suck.  You earned a beating.␀␀ˇˇNot bad. Maybe you should join our squad.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat Frisbee might be helpful.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDance in front of jocks to distract them.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~R2~ + ~s~ to start the cow dance, followed by the prompted button presses to dance.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~R2~ to stop the Cow Dance, but be careful it will fail the dance.␀␀ˇˇUse the Cow Dance to distract the jocks and avoid fighting them.␀␀ˇˇYou left the school grounds.␀␀ˇˇI keep forgetting how dorky that is.␀␀ˇˇYou are ridiculous, yet amusing.  Well done. ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDid you hear how that other team all went to a nudist beach together?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhere the hell are you girls running off to?!  GET BACK HERE!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCome on mascot, do your thing.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, remember when I used to kick your ass mascot?␀␀␀␀ˇˇMan, I think the nerds still have those pictures of Mandy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNot bad for a guy in a furry animal outfit.␀␀␀ˇˇThe jocks keep their game sports drink in a cooler.  Go urinate in it. Enhance it, if you will.␀␀␀ˇˇGet off the field you costumed freak.  We're running a practice here!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇEverybody!  The mascot's trying to make us look bad!␀␀ˇˇYou know what happens when you screw up.␀␀ˇˇSo pathetic.␀␀ˇˇHaha. Funny joke.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTime to dance, and you better not mess up.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat'd you do to our real mascot?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's see your moves.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, you!  What do you think you're doing?␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat are you doing to the Bull?!␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy. Nice outfit.␀␀␀ˇˇLast one in the locker room is a rotten egg.␀␀ˇˇI'm so going to kick ass in this game.  I'm on the top of my game.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey guys, I think our mascot is going to embarrass us.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNice work mascot-boy.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey Bucky, tell me what I gotta do.␀␀␀ˇˇYeah I know.  Shows off my figure doesn't it?  But enough about me, how do I mess up those Jocks?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHa ha. No.  But it will do.  Okay, here's the deal...␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAlright gotta get a plan.  What's the plan?␀␀␀ˇˇYou!  What are you doing?␀␀␀␀␀Fë␀␀␀␀«”␀␀␀␀ ò␀A␀␀␀ﬂ£0␀Y␀␀␀qÁ0␀ç␀␀␀˛m1␀µ␀␀␀÷‰Q␀·␀␀␀xnR␀␀␀ÛÆR␀E␀␀è≤R␀U␀␀ıR␀y␀␀™˛S␀È␀␀∫t␀E␀␀ˇt␀ô␀␀›ëv␀Õ␀␀ãÄñ␀˘␀␀¡Mó␀␀␀>“∏␀A␀␀Lπ␀e␀␀Bóπ␀â␀␀˛)ª␀π␀␀Ë§€␀·␀␀°˝˛␀␀␀'˛˛␀I␀␀∂Éˇ␀m␀␀Ü∏…␀␀•@ Â␀␀@L!˘␀␀=éB␀␀ﬁôC9␀␀O,]␀␀s„,ç␀␀ñ1.ù␀␀3.Ì␀␀üú)␀␀.îΩ]␀␀ÀüæÅ␀␀R‚æ•␀␀÷eø’␀␀ﬁfø˝␀␀Â©øa␀␀Õ$‡ù␀␀R-≈␀␀ﬁp˘␀␀Ì≥=␀␀nµe␀␀¡Ö␀␀D—␀␀G%	␀␀+HY	␀␀¬ZHy	␀␀D\iç	␀␀Sfj’	␀␀ﬁ®jÌ	␀␀÷©ã	
