s leave this 'king of the school' to his pathetic little fantasies.␀␀␀ˇˇYou are an idiot, Hopkins.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI've got a photograph.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou know what you can do with that, don't you?␀␀␀␀Û0Æ␀␀␀Ù0Æ%␀␀␀ı0ÆI␀␀␀ˆ0Æu␀␀␀˜0Æ…␀␀␀¯0Æ␀␀˘0Æ%␀␀˙0ÆQ␀␀˚0Æô␀␀u1Æ≈␀␀v1Æı␀␀w1ÆE␀␀x1Æq␀␀y1Æ©␀␀z1ÆŸ␀␀{1Æ˘␀␀|1Æ␀␀}1Æ!␀␀~1Æ9␀␀¯1ÆU␀␀˘1Æâ␀␀˙1Æ≠␀␀˚1Æ—␀␀¸1Æ␀␀˝1Æ=␀␀˛1ÆY␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀4Õ´␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀‡␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀BD␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh, here he is! Mr Big!␀␀␀ˇˇYeah, it was you, creep!␀␀ˇˇWhat was me?␀␀ˇˇDon't play innocent with us.␀␀ˇˇI tried that when father caught me with nanny.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe gave me a good thrashing,␀␀ˇˇand I've got half a mind to give you one.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, look, just get to the point.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSomeone stole our boxing trophies, buddy.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThey were heirlooms.␀␀ˇˇWell it wasn't me rich boy, so relax.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell if it wasn't you, then who was it?␀␀␀ˇˇI bet it was those greaseballs.␀␀␀ˇˇI know it! They've always hated us.␀␀␀ˇˇSo much for peace in our time, pauper!␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust great. Let's get them.␀␀␀ˇˇYes, it's time to teach those poor, disrespectful scum a lesson.␀␀ˇˇWait... relax. Maybe it wasn't them.␀␀ˇˇMaybe it was someone else?␀␀␀␀ˇˇNobody hates us, apart from them.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh yeah they do, everyone hates you, you're all awful!␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh, la-de-da, now he tells us!␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou are pathetic, Hopkins.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're not a leader. Out of my way.␀