 from her 58th honeymoon, then I'm outta here.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHow is that a minor setback?␀␀ˇˇLosers.␀␀␀ˇˇShut up, you fat dork.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhatever. You and your has-been friend don't scare me.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee? Even a dork like that laughs at me.␀␀ˇˇWe gotta prove Gary was behind everything.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWe don't even know if it was Gary.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAll we know is townie kids beat up a bunch of Bullworth kids.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI mean I don't even care anymore.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell, we've got to find out what's going on. Come on.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOK, but if we're gonna take on those townies,␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇwe're gonna need a bunch of back-up.␀␀ˇˇSomeone big, who doesn't hate me yet.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRussell!␀␀ˇˇHe'll be at his house in Old Bullworth Vale.␀␀ôÇÍ␀␀␀öÇÍ!␀␀␀õÇÍE␀␀␀úÇÍÅ␀␀␀ùÇÍ≈␀␀␀ûÇÍ—␀␀␀üÇÍ␀␀†ÇÍE␀␀°ÇÍe␀␀ÉÍù␀␀ÉÍ¡␀␀ÉÍ␀␀ÉÍU␀␀ÉÍm␀␀ ÉÍ©␀␀!ÉÍÈ␀␀"ÉÍ	␀␀#ÉÍ␀␀$ÉÍ1␀␀ûÉÍm␀␀üÉÍô␀␀†ÉÍ…␀␀°ÉÍÒ␀␀¢ÉÍ5␀␀£ÉÍ]␀␀§ÉÍô␀␀•ÉÍÕ␀␀¶ÉÍı␀␀ßÉÍ!␀␀!ÑÍ-␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀4Õ´␀␀␀␀␀␀␀l␀␀P␀␀␀
