t's with the new kid in Block B?␀␀␀ˇˇDon't they all.  I guess we'll have to knock him out with the ether.␀␀ˇˇThe Dropouts set me up.␀␀␀ˇˇLooks like a quiet shift.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHow'd you get in there to begin with?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy, I'm hurtin' here.␀␀ˇˇAin't nothin' crazy about what I did and you know it.  You'd have done the same. ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet outta here or I'm calling the cops.␀␀␀ˇˇWaitaminute!  Who are you?  Where am I?␀␀␀ˇˇ"Sure, let me buzz you in."␀␀␀ˇˇYeah, keeps going on about how he's not crazy and how he got framed and blah blah blah.␀␀␀ˇˇYou want your break?␀␀ˇˇAre you that new guy?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect +10␀␀␀ˇˇHelp Johnny escape.␀␀␀ˇˇJohnny␀␀␀␀ˇˇEscape the asylum with Johnny.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ ~t~ Unlock cell doors␀␀␀␀ˇˇFind a way out of the asylum.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇExit the asylum.␀␀ˇˇJohnny was knocked out.␀␀␀ÄØ1␀␀␀␀9»u␀␀␀␀ø»u␀A␀␀␀Yëv␀e␀␀␀pË€␀â␀␀␀Ü˙•␀␀␀f:Ò␀␀␀R„í␀␀S„íU␀␀T„íÖ␀␀⁄ÂíΩ␀␀aÊíŸ␀␀úëΩı␀␀S°æ␀␀Â&øA␀␀Ôrç␀␀Ä|π␀␀¡Ì␀␀˘ˇ$␀␀/H5␀␀7úiq␀␀‘ejï␀␀Ÿßj—␀␀·J¶␀␀`≤≠␀␀òDØY␀␀FË¬Å␀␀O«≥7°␀␀øHÄ8≈␀␀ÍŸÅ8Â␀␀Ò⁄Å8˝␀␀qÇ8Y␀␀{mvAq␀␀Ó;Iç␀␀ä£Än≠␀␀AFÁnŸ␀␀Ü⁄Ën␀␀¡	oI␀␀YQ	oe␀␀˝
