e escaped.␀␀␀ˇˇYou attacked the students.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet the fire extinguisher.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSearch the gym for the pyromaniac.␀␀␀␀ˇˇCatch the townie before he escapes.␀␀␀ˇˇPut out all the fires before the cops arrive.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSave all the students.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTalk to Mandy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't let the townie get away.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThere are no fires downstairs.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'll check it out... you get out of here.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUhm... Jimmy... would you mind helping me again?  Please?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're not wanted here school boy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat's more like it.␀␀ˇˇHahaha!  I lit a little fire under your butt didn't I.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI hate that school!  Hate it hate it hate it!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth is run by psychopaths!  You know that!␀␀ˇˇNo problem, Mandy, you'll be ok.␀␀ˇˇI regret NOTHING!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI hope no one's getting hurt. Oh Jimmy, won't you save them?␀␀ˇˇThere he is, get him!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOutta my way schoolboy!␀␀␀ˇˇBe careful Jimmy.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet lost brat.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSomebody help me!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWho set fire to the gym?␀␀ˇˇThanks man!␀␀␀ˇˇWhere are the others?  Is everyone ok?␀␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy!  Please save the gym!  Please!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey new guy.␀␀ˇˇBurn baby burn!  Ahahaha!  I told you you'd all be sorry for expelling me.␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh Jimmy!  Thank you!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat happened, Mandy?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ"Hey guy, help me out here!"␀␀ˇˇThe gym!  How could you do it!?␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy!  The fire!  Please get the fire!␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy... over here!␀␀␀ˇˇAdmit it! You wish you'd done it yourself.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're nothing but a terrorist Hopkins!␀␀␀ˇˇOh, thanks a lot.  I could've done that myself.␀␀␀ˇˇOver here!  Help me please.␀␀␀l•0␀␀␀␀˚È0␀␀␀␀	∞1␀1␀␀␀nR␀e␀␀␀ï∫S␀ç␀␀␀˝t␀•␀␀␀Ω	v␀¡␀␀␀=—∏␀Ÿ␀␀␀<Tπ␀␀␀›`€␀%␀␀+‹␀]␀␀h-Ö␀␀ê0.ô␀␀≈˘áΩ␀␀a/µ—␀␀b/µÈ␀␀c/µ	␀␀d/µ!␀␀·/µA␀␀‚/µa␀␀„/µâ␀␀Î0µ±␀␀Ï0µÂ␀␀Ì0µ␀␀i1µ␀␀j1µ9␀␀zõ]␀␀"íΩç␀␀π◊ΩÕ␀␀ºæı␀␀G]æ␀␀n¨øI␀␀%õﬂ}␀␀À‚ﬂ±␀␀«d‡’␀␀…d‡Ì␀␀Xg‡-␀␀[ÌI␀␀{{e␀␀`Îj}␀␀/ãë␀␀˝9Æ©␀␀
