d Zoe.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSabotage the potties.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMeet Zoe at the park in Old Bullworth Vale.␀␀␀ˇˇBurton finished using the potty.␀␀ˇˇBurton finished his run.␀␀ˇˇI am NOT going in there.␀␀ˇˇHeh.  Thanks.  He sure had it coming.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDid you get them?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNo shenanigans Hopkins!  I'm watching you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDestroy the potties before Mr. Burton finishes his run.␀␀␀ˇˇSabotaged the porta-potty.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat arrogant bastard's going down!␀␀␀ˇˇYeah, I got them.  Now what?␀␀ˇˇReturn to the park.␀␀␀ˇˇHide in the last potty.␀␀␀ˇˇPush the porta-potty over the ledge.␀␀ˇˇZoe now likes you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet the boltcutters.␀␀ˇˇTravel to the hardware store in Bullworth Town.␀␀␀ˇˇGet the boltcutters.␀␀ˇˇRam the tractor into the potty.␀␀␀ˇˇI'll take care of this... you make sure he doesn't use one of the other ones.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI bet Hopkins is behind this somehow.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThis sounds like it's going to be good.␀␀␀ˇˇDamn vandals.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat's going on out there?␀␀␀␀ˇˇMan, that's pretty nasty.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSee anything exciting?␀␀␀␀ˇˇReturn to Zoe to exact revenge on Mr. Burton.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou left the park.␀␀␀␀p1␀␀␀␀—Nv␀-␀␀␀∑Kó␀©␀␀␀≠ˇ˛␀¡␀␀␀Æ©Ñ·␀␀␀„[E
