e overloaded.␀␀␀␀ˇˇReset the generator switches to restore the power.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSwitches~n~~i~/~i~␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou attacked Zoe.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇZoe␀␀␀ˇˇReset both generator switches.␀␀␀␀ˇˇReset the breaker.␀␀␀␀ˇˇReset the breaker located inside the Wonder Meats building.␀␀␀ˇˇGo to the Red Star building.␀␀ˇˇFind your way around to the chem plant.␀␀␀ˇˇFind Omar and get the key to the plant.␀␀␀ˇˇGet to the chem plant entrance.␀␀␀ˇˇGo to the trainyard and find a way around.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet the key to the chem plant.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFind the switch to let Zoe through.␀␀␀ˇˇHe's still here!  Get him!␀␀␀␀ˇˇ... and to do that, we've got to take on Omar.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYeah.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWe gotta cut through the train yards.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇShow him what we got for him!␀␀␀␀␀{vt␀␀␀␀#Au␀␀␀␀%Bu␀i␀␀␀™ó␀ë␀␀␀aﬁπ␀Ω␀␀␀zd∫␀␀␀ÅË∫␀%␀␀]a€␀M␀␀i'‹␀e␀␀6˛␀Å␀␀∏˛␀°␀␀Æƒˇ␀≈␀␀c^,ı␀␀e#-%␀␀(ìΩ=␀␀i´øY␀␀Ë´‡i␀␀'H…␀␀“h%␀␀V+åA␀␀h.åY␀␀¶è7µ␀␀¶6≤7Ò␀␀Må’7␀␀h”’7I␀␀’—ˆ7q␀␀”˜7ô␀␀Ï⁄˜7±␀␀j;8␀␀ôt<8␀␀)^8=␀␀|‰£8q␀␀¬óg=â␀␀√óg=π␀␀ƒóg=Ò␀␀≈óg=	␀␀∆óg=!␀␀eÔ I)␀␀fÔ IM␀␀gÔ Ie␀␀hÔ I•␀␀iÔ I≈␀␀jÔ IÒ␀␀kÔ I␀␀lÔ IA␀␀mÔ Iq␀␀ﬂÄ⁄kï␀␀˘f¢nΩ␀␀6˚ƒn›␀␀rUËn␀␀>¿Oo␀␀ËYµoI␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀