my.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't worry.  Russell will get it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet lost Jimmy!  You ain't nothing!␀␀␀ˇˇNooo!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇOh...  it's the thug.  Don't worry boys, I'll deal with him.␀␀ˇˇYou're getting really tiresome Derby.  Cut it out.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSlow down so Russell can smash you!␀␀␀ˇˇSearch the school buildings for the faction leaders.␀␀ˇˇTake out the greasers.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake out the preps.␀␀␀ˇˇTake out the nerds.␀␀␀ˇˇTake out the jocks.␀␀␀ˇˇTake out Gary.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo is it true what they say Jimmy?  About you and those animals?␀␀ˇˇAwh, did I hurt your feelings Jimmy?␀␀ˇˇYou're sick in the head Jimmy, and everybody knows it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGary you little bitch!  Come out!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're just asking for it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPinky told me you were a horrific kisser, Jimmy.␀␀ˇˇSlow as always, eh Jimmy?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWe've got the suspect.  Pinned him in the vicinity of wonder meats.␀␀␀ˇˇThanks Jimmy.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat the hell are you doing Johnny?  Why are you taking orders from Gary?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJames, I've been waiting.  Let the games begin!␀␀␀ˇˇYou fool!  You don't see it.  Gary's got a plan.  A great plan.␀␀␀ˇˇEdgar, go help get everyone calm down.  I've got some business with Gary.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHA HA HA!  This is the best!␀␀ˇˇYou've left the school grounds.␀␀␀ˇˇRussell␀␀␀ˇˇReturn to the school.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRussell got knocked out.␀␀ˇˇFind the last faction leader.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGive it up Jimmy.  You're pathetic.␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy  you know your mother never loved you, don't you?␀␀␀ˇˇYou don't get it. With my brains and his lack of morals nothing can stop us.␀␀ˇˇYou idiot.  Gary's plans are all a load of crap. I should know.␀␀␀ˇˇWhatever.  I'm going to stop you both.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat... kinda... hurt.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat was incredibly satisfying.␀␀␀ˇˇYou're finished you buncha bitches.␀␀␀ˇˇShut up Jimmy!  You left us and everything went down the toilet.␀␀ˇˇIt was laughably easy to manipulate you.  Does that bother you Jimmy?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's too late, Jimmy - everyone hates you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇUnderstood.  Good luck.␀␀␀ˇˇEarnest, you nerd, what are you THINKING?!␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe's a Bullworth student.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey Derby, someone's here to see you.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRRRRAAARRR!␀␀␀Ô§␀␀␀␀\ 0␀␀␀␀p*R␀i␀␀␀ÜÚR␀±␀␀␀†zS␀’␀␀␀pË€␀␀␀˚˝␀-␀␀£Åˇ␀}␀␀ƒ"π␀␀“"Ò␀␀±JB-␀␀™ãBï␀␀>éBπ␀␀YôC˘␀␀~˛ö%␀␀ˇöQ␀␀Ñˇöu␀␀␀õç␀␀g$-°␀␀†ú¡␀␀Ÿ^ùÈ␀␀p´ø␀␀ÕÍ5␀␀¬]␀␀&Hi␀␀∆ùH©␀␀␀Ø·␀␀Ë≠)	␀␀È≠)A␀␀Í≠)]␀␀Î≠)u␀␀Ï≠)ç␀␀Ì≠)•␀␀>˛ë7π␀␀≠ª≤7˝␀␀ÕÖ≥7%␀␀Y»≥7a␀␀„ò˜7â␀␀˙¢8©␀␀m8›␀␀äs]8˝␀␀u]8E␀␀ï˘]8Y␀␀'˚]8©␀␀⁄	_8›␀␀‡Å8!␀␀Ò^£8q␀␀¢u,:ë␀␀3ÓÍLµ␀␀œ^⁄Y¡␀␀ \›␀␀Çe˘␀␀ÌÄn	␀␀Ò]ÄnE	␀␀ˆ]ÄnÅ	␀␀âhÅn—	␀␀™¢n
