'm very pleased with your progress Jimmy.  You show real promise.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou know Jimmy, you have a bit of a rough edge but I really think there's something special about you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNice work Jimmy... you're quite the photographer.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the main school building.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the Bullworth statue.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the Bullworth Dam.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the beach lighthouse.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the carnival.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of Bullworth City Hall.␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the old Bullworth Church.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake a photo of the burger joint.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWelcome back everybody.  I hope none of you forgot your cameras.␀␀ˇˇWelcome to photography class, I'm Ms. Philips.␀␀␀␀⁄Î‡␀␀␀…"j=␀␀␀b¡Iù␀␀␀c¡Iπ␀␀␀d¡I’␀␀␀e¡IÒ␀␀␀f¡I␀␀g¡I1␀␀h¡IU␀␀i¡I]␀␀j¡Iç␀␀‰¡I—␀␀Â¡I␀␀Ê¡II␀␀Á¡Iy␀␀Y˜7©␀␀Ï†8␀␀…JÄ8M␀␀oÇ8µ␀␀Ü££8˝␀␀'§8i␀␀¢ßg°␀␀£ßg—␀␀§ßg˝␀␀•ßg%␀␀¶ßgQ␀␀ßßgu␀␀®ßgù␀␀©ßgÕ␀␀îÂ
