m now on.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou seem to have trouble adjusting to Bullworth life.  You will have to try harder.␀␀␀ˇˇEgging cars?  You can do better than that.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt seems even the girls at Bullworth despise you... well that's encouraging.␀␀ˇˇI don't think you know what kindness means.␀␀␀ˇˇPaying you to harass poor people makes me feel good about myself.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWill you get back my package?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNow, Derby is really stupid, malevolent and rich...␀␀␀ˇˇI know somewhere you can crash tonight.␀␀␀ˇˇThanks son.␀␀␀ˇˇGo-Kart Race 1␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo-Kart Race 2␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo-Kart Race 3␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo-Kart Race 4␀␀␀␀ˇˇGo-Kart Race 5␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~i~␀␀␀ˇˇMin␀␀␀ˇˇ~i~%␀␀ˇˇThis 'borrowing' of bikes you do... it has to end Jimmy.␀␀ˇˇThe prefects have been commenting on your tendencies towards violence.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~tod~␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSpider Web␀␀␀␀ˇˇYes␀␀␀ˇˇso it will surprise none of you to discover in a future life he'll end up in congress.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou seem to spend an inordinate of time in washrooms.  Most curious.␀␀ˇˇVere is your kostume, you svine?!?␀␀␀␀ˇˇMr. Galloway seems to think you're hopeless in English.  I would tend to agree.␀␀␀ˇˇI'm sick of this place.  Let's break out.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've been fighting with the local children Jimmy?  Why do you even associate with them?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHmm... when an officer of the law gives you an instruction, you are to obey it.  Do you understand?␀␀␀ˇˇSome kids like to write on walls that don't belong to them.  You got a camera.  Take some pictures of them.␀␀␀ˇˇMy old lady is cheating on me.  Can you get me some pics so she won't take half when I divorce her?␀␀␀ˇˇThanks for doing that.␀␀␀␀ˇˇOK, now all we gotta do is get back to the library.␀␀␀ˇˇYou are to respect the property and persons of the town Jimmy!  Do you hear me?␀␀␀ˇˇYou should stop fooling around in shop class.  You might learn something useful for your future.␀␀ˇˇSomeone needs to send those preps a message.  Tag up their part of town.  Can you do it?␀␀ˇˇMrs.McRae␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI would have hoped that at least shop class would suit you.  But no, even menial labor seems too difficult.␀␀␀ˇˇWell Jimmy, you'll have to learn that there's a price for misbehaving.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI understand that you dislike these so-called 'greasers', but this fighting is getting out of hand.␀␀␀ˇˇAttic␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThat is all Hopkins.␀␀ˇˇOne of those stupid bullies kidnapped by teddy bear, will you get it back?␀␀␀␀ˇˇTime expired.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you wanna be cool you gotta prove it and smash some cars.␀␀ˇˇBeach Bucket Hat␀␀ˇˇUrban Bucket Hat␀␀ˇˇBreaking into lockers?  That's illegal you know.␀␀ˇˇWith the trustfund babies under control, it's time to turn my attention to their sworn enemies, those greaseball kids.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI need you to take a picture of my corrupt colleague.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey look at that teachers pet!␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf we get pictures of those spray painting vandals maybe we can put an end to their nonsense.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇEggs are for cooking, not throwing Jimmy.  Just ask Edna.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYour 'reputation' gets you nowhere with me, young man.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGot some extra coins?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLooks like you've been quite busy, eh Jimmy?␀␀ˇˇAll right you feckless maggots... we'll be playing dodgeball for the next while.␀␀ˇˇNah...␀␀␀␀ˇˇPerhaps you should leave Bullworth and become a gambler.  It seems your heart is more in that.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe transformer is damaged and the gate opened, you dunces!  Fall back.␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy, it seems like you just left my office... and now you're back again.␀␀␀␀ˇˇBrawling with adults Jimmy?!  That's just unacceptable.␀␀␀ˇˇBut this is my story, not his.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell... it looks like you've fought your way to the top Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNow get out of here.␀␀ˇˇDon't worry, they're not too dangerous.  Not that much.␀␀␀ˇˇDo not talk back to teachers Jimmy.  Is even such a basic concept beyond you?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou might as well get used to working off your bad deeds.  I understand it's quite common in prison.␀␀ˇˇHey man, can you get me some TP?  It's a bit of an emergency.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo... you're the one behind the recent spate of bike thefts.  I see.␀␀ˇˇYou know, you really shouldn't struggle when the prefects approach you.␀␀␀ˇˇGray Bullworth T-Shirt␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Polo Shirt␀␀ˇˇTeam Polo Shirt␀␀␀ˇˇTeam T-Shirt␀␀ˇˇTeam Football Jersey␀␀ˇˇTeam B-ball Jersey - White␀␀␀␀ˇˇTeam B-ball Jersey - Red␀␀ˇˇTeam B-ball Jersey - Blue␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ+~f~␀␀ˇˇThere are several reports of townspeople having to restrain you.  I am shocked.␀␀␀ˇˇI'll be taking some of these things... obviously you'll just use them to get in trouble.␀␀ˇˇBut this place is a rotten onion...␀␀␀ˇˇPerhaps you should stop chasing girls so much and focus on your studies.␀␀ˇˇIt seems you've been preying on the weak, making them cry and so forth.␀␀␀ˇˇ"It's not funny, please get him."␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIsn't there a law against slave labor?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHe was always so nice to me....␀␀␀ˇˇHey kid, I need you to run a delivery for me.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBusting In Part II␀␀␀␀ˇˇJerry␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo you really think smashing up mail boxes is a good idea?␀␀␀␀ˇˇWHISTLES Come on boy, I have a treat for you!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou could do a little public service, it will do you good.  Go mow the lawn.␀␀ˇˇI see you got a lousy mark in Chemistry.  Too busy chasing girls?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇwhose alumni are nothing but arms dealers, serial killers and corporate lawyers.␀␀ˇˇI suppose you do most of your sleeping in class Jimmy?  Certainly, you don't seem to sleep when you're supposed to.␀␀␀ˇˇThis recent spate of vandalism HAS to come to an end.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI appreciate it, young man.␀␀␀ˇˇ"Aw, make him stop. Please, Jimmy?"␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~t~ to exit your hiding spot.␀␀␀ˇˇWhere is the toilet paper!?␀␀␀ˇˇNow Jimmy, why don't you try to show that you've understood the seriousness of all this?␀␀ˇˇVictimizing social losers is a time honored tradition Jimmy, but I feel you've been going overboard.␀␀ˇˇDude, where's my bike?␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou seem to have an aptitude for senseless destruction, Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat is it Jimmy? What are you afraid of? Wrestling is SERIOUS, now stop failing the damn class!␀␀ˇˇHaha!  Someone's in trouble.␀␀ˇˇAh... I see.  Perhaps your attitude can be explained by your bad luck with girls?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've become quite the little bike thief it appears.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI am told that you are always in trouble Jimmy.  Very disappointing.␀␀ˇˇThe METROtown␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe OUTback␀␀␀ˇˇThe NUCLEAR section␀␀␀ˇˇYou better not do anything to disturb the football team's training program.␀␀␀ˇˇWould you at least TRY to apply yourself in art class?␀␀␀␀ˇˇI'll get straight to the point.  I wish to show my affection to someone by placing a gift in their locker.  Can you help?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇA friend in need is a friend indeed friend.␀␀␀ˇˇI do wish you would stop this bannister sliding of yours.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, can you lend me a dollar?␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat is it with you and writing on walls Jimmy?  Grafitti is not an artform, get it through your head.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDigital Camera␀␀␀␀ˇˇOutdoor Go-Kart Track␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's see what we've got, shall we?␀␀␀ˇˇThere's this girl you see... and I want to put some chocolates in her locker.  Will you do it?␀␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy, won't you walk with me a while?␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're in my domain now Jimmy!!  Prepare to SUFFER!␀␀␀ˇˇAnd now you've added cruelty to dogs?  That's just charming.␀␀ˇˇYou know what would be cool?  If you egged the girls' dorm.  Come on, do it!␀␀ˇˇThanks a lot, Jimmy.␀␀ˇˇUpper body␀␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFind and guide the patients back.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~x~ to keep the ball up␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUse the change room to change into your wrestling outfit and attend gym class.␀␀␀␀ˇˇReturn candy to Pedro.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't Hurt Me!␀␀␀␀ˇˇOww!␀␀ˇˇTiny Swimsuit␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Enter␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇComplete Mayhem␀␀␀ˇˇAre in you in need of some support fire?␀␀ˇˇYour go-kart is at the school parking lot beside the bike garage.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWrestling Uniform␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇClown Pants␀␀␀ˇˇ~a~␀␀␀ˇˇSchool Uniform␀␀␀␀ˇˇSchool Uniform␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Enter code␀␀␀␀ˇˇHigh Striker␀␀ˇˇYou fell too far behind.␀␀ˇˇPress the ~t~" ~w~button to enter or exit a vehicle.␀␀ˇˇThen fire using the ~o~| ~w~button.␀␀␀ˇˇThen fire using the ~h~R1 ~w~button.␀␀ˇˇStop in the ~q~pink marker.␀␀␀ˇˇThere are eight different types of weapon.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou can carry one of each type of