gym class.~n~ ~n~- Burton␀␀␀␀ˇˇJobs~n~ ~n~Want to make extra cash?~n~ ~n~Follow the ~job~ icon~n~on the world map.␀␀␀ˇˇNeed Money?~n~ ~n~Harrington House employs poor students for menial work.~n~ ~n~Please see Chad or Gord.␀␀ˇˇPillow Fight~n~ ~n~Tonight.~n~Girls' dorm.~n~ ~n~No boys allowed.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRubber Bands~n~ ~n~There are 75 rubber bands scattered throughout the world.~n~ ~n~Collect them all for a special prize.␀␀ˇˇWet Proof Sheets~n~ ~n~Now available!~n~ ~n~Algernon and others who may need them,~n~see Miss Peabody.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLost Letter~n~ ~n~I lost a letter from~n~my mummy. Please~n~return it.~n~ ~n~- Algernon␀␀␀ˇˇMuseum Trip~n~CANCELLED~n~ ~n~Money needed for football team.~n~ ~n~- Burton␀␀ˇˇHarrington House Social Event~n~ ~n~Monday at 7:00 PM.~n~ ~n~By invitation only.␀␀ˇˇAstronomy Club~n~ ~n~Meeting postponed~n~due to jock attacks.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMascot Assaulted~n~ ~n~Beating up the~n~mascot is funny,~n~but not allowed.~n~ ~n~- Burton␀␀␀␀ˇˇBad Math Grades?~n~ ~n~See me and we can~n~work something out.~n~ ~n~- Mr. Hattrick␀␀␀ˇˇFootball Team~n~ ~n~If you miss practice, don't bother showing~n~up again. Broken~n~bones is no excuse.~n~ ~n~- Burton␀␀␀␀ˇˇLost Cat~n~ ~n~Black Cat, answers to name of "Malevich".~n~ ~n~Please return to Ms. Philips in Art Room.␀␀ˇˇSorry Russell~n~ ~n~Please don't hurt me.~n~ ~n~- Pedro␀␀␀ˇˇNotice:~n~ ~n~Please DO NOT~n~pick the flowers~n~from in front of~n~the girls' dorm.␀␀ˇˇWARNING:~n~ ~n~If the prefects catch anyone hitting or teasing girls, they'll be sent straight to the principal's office.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou dumb cow!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~x~ - Pedal~n~ ~n~~s~ - Brake~n~ ~n~~o~ - Bunny Hop~n~ ~n~~t~ - Dismount␀␀ˇˇTap ~x~ repeatedly to pedal faster.␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~t~ when you're close to a bike to get on.␀␀ˇˇAfternoon class is about to start. It goes from 1pm until 3:30pm.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPull back on the left analog stick and tap ~x~ to pop a wheelie.␀␀ˇˇPush forward on the left analog stick while holding down ~s~ to perform an endo.␀␀ˇˇPull the left analog stick back while in the air to perform a backflip.␀␀␀ˇˇGurney␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~x~ - ~s_sorry~ Apologize~n~ ~n~~o~ - ~s_humil~ Humiliate␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~x~ - ~s_sorry~ Apologize␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe Big Prank ~mission~ is only available on halloween night.~n~~n~Sleep and you'll lose your chance to complete it.␀␀ˇˇUse this to go skateboarding␀␀ˇˇTuxedo Jacket␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDuffel Coat␀␀␀ˇˇLS Casual Jacket␀␀ˇˇUse this to fire all sorts of projectiles␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhen your trouble meter fills, prefects will try to bust you on sight.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPrefects are the red dots on the radar. Watch out for them.␀␀␀ˇˇFlag␀␀ˇˇFERRISWHEEL␀␀␀ˇˇMove close to Constantinos and hold ~L1~ to target him.␀␀␀ˇˇSpandex Bike Shorts unlocked.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFire Crackers are now~n~available from your chem set␀␀ˇˇStink Bombs are now~n~available from your chem set␀␀␀␀ˇˇItching Powder is now~n~available from your chem set␀␀ˇˇFull ammo is now~n~available from your chem set␀␀␀ˇˇYour chem set is now~n~ available all the time␀␀␀␀ˇˇBuy / Trade␀␀␀ˇˇSpray greaser tags.␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned the ability to apologize to prefects for small crimes.␀␀ˇˇHold ~L1~ and press ~o~ to ~s_shove~ shove taunt.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHold ~L1~ and press ~x~ to ~s_sorry~ apologize.␀␀␀ˇˇSpray ~i~ tag.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~L1~ + ~x~ - Do the Cow Dance~n~ ~n~Use the Cow Dance to get Jocks to leave you alone.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGet a life you dork!␀␀ˇˇA high power projectile weapon␀␀␀␀ˇˇEnter scope mode by pressing ~dup~ twice.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBully ko'd.␀␀␀ˇˇGo to the alley next to the junkyard to race between 7PM and 7AM␀␀ˇˇHey kid, wanna help me find my lost medication?  I'll pay.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFighting?  Again?  I suppose when you hang out with those carnival types that's not surprising.␀␀␀ˇˇSo nice of you to drop by my office on your way to prison, young man.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou know we can't associate with you until you wear some proper clothes... hmmm?␀␀ˇˇYou've been disrespecting the prefects.  That is entirely unacceptable.␀␀␀ˇˇJimmy Hopkins we're really getting to know each other.  Isn't that nice?␀␀ˇˇWe shall see, my friend.  I only give people what they have coming to them.␀␀␀ˇˇThose rats are driving me nuts!  One of them ate my smokes.  Kill 'em for me.  I'll pay ya' good money.␀␀␀ˇˇOne moment, I'll get your record.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMouthing off to the police Jimmy?  It will land you in jail one day.␀␀ˇˇSeems even something as reprehensible as photo journalism is beyond you.␀␀ˇˇBack so soon Hopkins?  Do you ever learn?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt would seem you suffer some sort of anxiety about sports?  Why else would you fight our star athletes?␀␀ˇˇSliding down bannisters is not appropriate behavior for a Bullworth student.␀␀ˇˇNerd insult␀␀␀ˇˇYour new safehouse is located on the beach by the lighthouse.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTest Area␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPerson Ballooned.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAquaberry Vest␀␀␀␀ˇˇUrban Parade Sweater␀␀ˇˇLambswool V-Neck Sweater␀␀ˇˇLS Training Jacket␀␀␀␀ˇˇAquaberry Sweater␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇKaren␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ"Jimmy can you help me, please?"␀␀ˇˇCan you help a buddy out?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPicking on the nerds Jimmy?  I agree, they are loathsome but that doesn't justify beating them up without permission.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAh.  Breaking into lockers.  I see.  You are intent on becoming a criminal, it seems.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI think it all goes down at the motel.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey - You need any help?␀␀ˇˇI was a prefect once and I will not abide by you being obnoxious to them.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFinally, everything is sorted out... more or less.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTrash cans are for garbage Jimmy, not people.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇKeeping the nerds in line is perhaps acceptable, but you should not let yourself get caught.␀␀ˇˇMr. Burton tells me that you've been doing abysmally in dodge ball.␀␀␀ˇˇMuch like real life, the strongest will prevail.␀␀ˇˇWater Balloons␀␀␀␀ˇˇSet!␀␀ˇˇReal scum.  And that old creep thinks he can tame me.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI need to go to the motel but I don't want to go alone.  Would you please walk me there?␀␀ˇˇGo show those paupers what you think of them.  Go on.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, you wanna do my driveway when you're done?␀␀␀ˇˇI have to get it back, will you help me?␀␀ˇˇJimmy... the Bullworth bedtime is not a suggestion, it's a rule.␀␀ˇˇHey there!␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Dunk␀␀ˇˇHey... wanna delivery job?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy... I need to get back to the girls' dorm.  Would you please walk me home?␀␀␀ˇˇWhy do you have to break into lockers Jimmy?  Why?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey! Don't hit my customers.␀␀ˇˇThanks kid. You're alright.␀␀␀ˇˇIt's not an air compressor you dolt.  Don't you know ANYTHING?␀␀␀␀ˇˇJohnny Vincent is a bad influence Jimmy.  I want you to stay away from him.␀␀␀ˇˇWriting rude words on walls is naughty Jimmy.  Didn't you mother teach you anything?␀␀ˇˇShoving people into the garbage!  Have you any idea of the health implications.␀␀␀ˇˇI used to have crabs in my bath tub.␀␀ˇˇIf you have to beat up the nerds, could you at least have the decency to do it out of sight.␀␀ˇˇWell... I don't suppose labor will really help the situation, but it's worth a try.␀␀␀ˇˇNo rest for the wicked certainly applies to you, it seems.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't let him get the spud cannon.  It is the key to our defenses!␀␀␀␀ˇˇProblems with over developed pituitary glands and brains the size of peas.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Pull alarm␀␀␀␀ˇˇDo the thing to get the Fake ID.␀␀ˇˇHey Jimmy, I appreciate you doing my job for me.␀␀ˇˇHey! That's my customer!␀␀ˇˇLooks like I'll have to confiscate some of YOUR stuff.  Maybe then you'll get the message.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you injure anyone on the football team you will be in serious trouble young man.␀␀␀ˇˇGambling for money Jimmy?  I'm not surprised.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAnother fight?  How many this week Jimmy?  How many?␀␀ˇˇSometimes I miss that jerk, you know?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou shouldn't have these things.␀␀ˇˇI can't beat that jerk up.  Will you do it for me?  Please?␀␀␀ˇˇCarnival rides have always fascinated me you know.  Please take some pictur␀␀␀ˇˇFigthing with the carnival workers?  Trying to get their jobs hmmmm?␀␀ˇˇYou are dismissed.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've gotten into a lot of trouble so soon Jimmy.  Is it a cry for help?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇRussell␀␀␀ˇˇ(~t~ ~s~ ~x~ ~t~ ~s~ ~x~ ~t~ ~s~ ~x~ ~o~)␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHit a girl and the prefects will bust you instantly if they get hold of you.␀␀ˇˇAll right you lazy bums... look alive!␀␀␀␀ˇˇGreat work, Jimmy boy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGirls don't like you.  It's a fact.  I suppose that goes a long way to explain things.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI've just taken control of two of the school's worst cliques, but I know there are bigger problems just around the corner.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, spare some change?␀␀␀ˇˇThere is no call for being flippant with the prefects Jimmy.␀␀ˇˇI'm beginning to get very tired of your shenanigans Hopkins.␀␀ˇˇ... and that's the last I want to hear of you Hopkins.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat should I do to improve your attitude young James?  You better pay a visit to the punishment prefect.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWho're you calling maggot, maggot?␀␀␀␀ˇˇTake out those satelite dishes.  They're cutting into my business.␀␀␀␀ˇˇOur curriculum does not include breaking things.  If it did, you'd be a star student.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI never meant for things to turn out this way. I just wanted to control a couple of psycho kids and be left alone.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Apply glue␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey there junior, thanks a bunch.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAh dodgeball... how I love the sound of boys crying in the morning.␀␀␀ˇˇThere will be no more complaints about you from our staff.  Do I make myself clear?␀␀␀ˇˇYou again Jimmy?  I'm disappointed, but not surprised.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThey stole it and I can't get it back.  Please help.␀␀ˇˇYou remind me of him when we were young.␀␀ˇˇYou seem to be constantly in trouble Jimmy.␀␀␀ˇˇFollow the ~mission~ to start a new task.~n~ ~n~Press ~dright~ to view available tasks.␀␀␀ˇˇNotice that the ~mission~ on the radar blinks.␀␀␀␀ˇˇRemember - Once you start a task, you cannot access your save book.␀␀␀ˇˇIncognito Hat␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe ~class~ on the radar is the location of your class.␀␀␀ˇˇMorning classes start at 9am and go~nbsp~until 11:30am.␀␀␀ˇˇUse the clock in the top left corner of the screen to keep track of time.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Hide␀␀ˇˇBilly Crane's circus has been complaining about you.  Imagine that!␀␀␀ˇˇI see the police had to bring you in.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe police have been wasting their time on you it seems.  Perhaps we should just be done with you and