dden fruit.␀␀ˇˇA house without a toilet is uncanny.␀␀ˇˇIf you're on high cliff, don't jump to conclusion.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIsn't it about time you got a job?␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're wasting your life.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇConsider a career in politics.␀␀␀␀ˇˇRunning behind a car is exhausting.␀␀␀ˇˇIf you live in a glass house, change in the basement.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTwo wrongs do not make a right, but 3 lefts do.␀␀␀ˇˇDo not argue with the person packing your parachute.␀␀ˇˇWhen things go wrong, don't follow along.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't forget to change your socks.␀␀␀␀ˇˇConfession is good for the soul but bad for your reputation.␀␀ˇˇNever test the depth of the water with both feet.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you put your face in fruit drink, you may get punch in nose.␀␀␀ˇˇTo make life interesting, believe everything you hear.␀␀␀␀ˇˇConsider trying less hard.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're a winner.  No really.  You are.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHave you considered running away from your problems?␀␀ˇˇThe smarter you think you are, the less likely it is that you're right.␀␀␀ˇˇGet over yourself.  Jerk.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe answer to your question is: maybe.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't be so self-centered.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou need a haircut.␀␀␀ˇˇBefore you act, check with your mother.␀␀␀ˇˇGet a life.␀␀␀ˇˇHelp!  I'm trapped inside this machine!␀␀␀ˇˇAll signs point to: no chance.␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust give up.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're smart and handsome, just like your mom always says you are.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf people flatter you they're probably lying.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBeware of angry men carrying weapons.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇConsider this: no turkey ever voted for an early Christmas.␀␀␀ˇˇBully is as bully does.␀␀␀ˇˇYou're doomed.  Sorry.␀␀␀␀ˇˇRegular showers are a good thing.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNo one likes a whiner.␀␀␀␀ˇˇBelieve the best of everbody.  It saves you so much trouble.␀␀ˇˇBy swallowing evil words unsaid, no one has ever harmed his stomach.␀␀ˇˇHowever beautiful the strategy, you should occasionally look at the results.␀␀ˇˇIt is always wise to look ahead, but difficult to look further than you can see.␀␀ˇˇWhat exactly is your problem?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're not all that.␀␀ˇˇConsider the possibility that no one likes you.␀␀␀ˇˇYou might as well keep trying.  It might make you feel better.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you don't try, you can't fail.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTravel broadens the mind, if you have one to begin with.␀␀ˇˇAll signs point to: you suck.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSurprisingly, you may succeed in the end.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat you really need is some sort of medication.␀␀ˇˇPeeing your own pants only keeps you warm for a short while.␀␀ˇˇBad advice causes mistakes, then laughter.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou can definitely fool some of the people some of the time.␀␀ˇˇIf your house is burning you might as well try to stay warm.␀␀ˇˇLove is blind; friendship closes its eyes.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou won't get anywhere if you think you're already there.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's a good time to stop waffling.  Maybe.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe weather pays no attention to criticism.␀␀␀ˇˇIf you expect nothing, you won't be disappointed.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhatever it is you're looking for, it'll be in the last place you look.␀␀␀ˇˇWhen in charge, think.  When in trouble, delegate.  When in doubt, mumble.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNothing is impossible for a man who doesn't have to do it himself.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't mistake a short memory for a clear conscience.␀␀ˇˇForgive your enemies - it really annoys them.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you're on time, people will think you have nothing important to do.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStand up to be seen.  Speak up to be heard.  Shut up to be appreciated.␀␀␀ˇˇ80% of people consider themselves above average.␀␀ˇˇKeep trying.␀␀ˇˇThe greatest danger could be your own stupidity.␀␀ˇˇAvoid taking unnecessary gambles.  Lucky numbers: 12, 32, 28, 31, 44.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou may attend a party where strange customs prevail.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou are almost there.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSoon you will have some new clothes.␀␀ˇˇDon't trust fortune tellers.␀␀ˇˇJust imagine you'll succeed.␀␀ˇˇEverything is not yet lost.␀␀␀ˇˇTomorrow will be a nice day.␀␀ˇˇYou should go to bed early tonight.␀␀␀ˇˇToday is the first day of the rest of your life, such as it is.␀␀␀ˇˇDon't blow out another's candle to make yours shine brighter.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThere's never time to do it right, but there's always time to do it over.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFacts don't stop existing just because they're ignored.␀␀␀ˇˇTo err is human, to blame someone else even more so.␀␀ˇˇIf life gives you lemons, give life a raspberry.␀␀ˇˇIf life gives you lemons consider going into the citrus business.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThose who cannot change their minds cannot change anything.␀␀␀ˇˇTo know nothing is bad.  To not wish to know anything, worse.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe pen is mightier than the sword, especially if properly sharpened and in the hands of a well trained ninja.␀␀␀␀ˇˇA man's home is his castle, only less resistant to catapults.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBig words prove nothing except that you have a big mouth.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you're a real jerk all the time, people might not notice you're useless.␀␀␀ˇˇNo plan survives contact with the enemy.  Plan accordingly.␀␀␀ˇˇIf at first you don't succeed, consider giving up.␀␀␀␀ˇˇToday, tell someone you love them.  You might get lucky.␀␀ˇˇIt's only going to get worse.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou will be involved in a fight soon.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDon't bring your wife to a bun fight.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBeing rude is no substitute for being right.␀␀ˇˇThe reality is: the customer is not always right.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf you don't succeed, you run the risk of failure.␀␀␀␀ˇˇA bird in the hand is better than a bird on the roof, unless it has really sharp claws.␀␀␀ˇˇRight now, somewhere out there, someone is making out with a girl.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's hard to prophecy, especially about the future.␀␀␀ˇˇDo you know who your friends are?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBoxing is a gentleman's sport, but only if gentlemen play it.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're not paranoid - everyone really does hate you.␀␀ˇˇThey say they're your friends, but they laugh at you behind your back.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're not as dumb as you look. That would be impossible.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIn later life, you will find somewhere you fit in and belong. Jail.␀␀␀ˇˇHave you considered getting plastic surgery? You should.␀␀ˇˇOne day you will be very famous, like many serial killers.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLet's hope you will¬†grow into your face.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYour face is your fortune. You will live in poverty all your life.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhat you looking at bitch!␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt's a yard stick.  Use it to measure yards␀␀␀ˇˇIt's a stick that requires 2 hands␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt appears to be the lid from a garbage can␀␀␀ˇˇIt's a brick.  ␀␀␀ˇˇThey're marbles.  I'll bet you could get into some mischief with those.␀␀␀ˇˇThese playful explosives are legal even for kids to own.␀␀ˇˇThis can of spuds would be perfect for anyone with a spudgun.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇReally useful if you have a bottle rocket launcher.␀␀␀ˇˇSmells like the boys' locker room.␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~i~ people stuffed into lockers.␀␀ˇˇReturn to Casey for a reward.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇEscort Christy to the motel.␀␀ˇˇCheckpoints complete.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou didn't hit anyone with any Water Balloons. Try again later.␀␀␀ˇˇ~s~␀␀␀ˇˇConstantinos␀␀ˇˇBully Respect -10␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWhatever...␀␀␀ˇˇMascot␀␀␀␀ˇˇAfter School␀␀ˇˇFootball Field␀␀␀␀ˇˇBefore School␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFood␀␀ˇˇFight␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMoney␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇStunt␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLightning␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTownie Respect -25␀␀␀␀ˇˇTownie Respect +25␀␀␀␀ˇˇMr.Carmichael␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMrs.Lisburn␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect -10␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect -20␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect -25␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect -75␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect +25␀␀␀ˇˇGreaser Respect +50␀␀␀ˇˇDamon␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDerby␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDavis␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇLeft arm␀␀ˇˇRight arm␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUpper body␀␀␀␀ˇˇTags complete.␀␀␀␀ˇˇJock Respect -10␀␀ˇˇJock Respect -20␀␀ˇˇJock Respect -75␀␀ˇˇJock Respect +10␀␀ˇˇJock Respect +15␀␀ˇˇJock Respect +60␀␀ˇˇHey Geekboy!␀␀ˇˇ~o~ REAPER␀␀␀␀ˇˇClothing Article␀␀ˇˇRevenge on Mr. Burton␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ"Burning Schoolhouse" firework␀␀␀␀ˇˇMr.Smith␀␀ˇˇDenny␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSpikes! - Blond␀␀␀ˇˇSpikes! - Green␀␀␀ˇˇSpikes! - Blue␀␀␀␀ˇˇSpikes! - Red␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou failed to smash any grave stones.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHigh Scores␀␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect -75␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect +10␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect +15␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect +20␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect +50␀␀ˇˇNerd Respect +60␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Start "~a~"␀␀␀ˇˇSmash grave stones.␀␀␀ˇˇ~i~/~i~␀␀␀ˇˇPreppy Respect -10␀␀␀␀ˇˇPreppy Respect -15␀␀␀␀ˇˇPreppy Respect -75␀␀␀␀ˇˇPreppy Respect +15␀␀␀␀ˇˇPreppy Respect +60␀␀␀␀ˇˇJohnny␀␀␀␀ˇˇTagging␀␀␀ˇˇYou didn't get the crabs in time.