a pity.  Would you do something about it?␀␀␀␀ˇˇFollow me, I'll get you a roof.␀␀␀ˇˇYou're doing badly in photography.  Jimmy... what are you good for?  Anything?␀␀␀␀ˇˇHow do you like it so far, James?  This is only the beginning... muahahaha!␀␀␀ˇˇCool Jimmy.  Thanks.␀␀ˇˇClown Shoes␀␀␀ˇˇYou'll have to stop all this brawling you engage in.␀␀ˇˇYou look like a nice boy... won't you get me out of here?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAll this fighting will simply have to stop.␀␀␀ˇˇYou think it's a good idea to act up Hopkins?  At this time?␀␀ˇˇI am not a fan of confiscating things, but you leave me no choice.␀␀␀␀ˇˇVandalism, destruction, disrespect... you're bound for a borstal if you don't smarten up.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇShowdown at the Plant␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCarnival Date␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHelp Gary␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWell... if it isn't young James Hopkins.  In trouble again.␀␀␀ˇˇI mean I don't want to say we're going to live happily ever after or anything like that, but life is certainly going to get easier␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou seem to think it's pretty damn funny to pull fire alarms don't you?␀␀␀ˇˇIt's been reported that you've been throwing newspapers at people.␀␀␀␀ˇˇGetting into fights with the school lowlifes?  I'm not surpised as much as disappointed Jimmy.␀␀␀␀ˇˇI got to get my friend out of class, he's got to help me with my homework.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou're credited with rampant vandalism and destruction.  Impressive. ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSomeone's starting all these little fires all over the place.  Go put 'em out will you?  I need to get something to eat.␀␀ˇˇIt appears you're too stupid to speak your native language properly.␀␀ˇˇYour rap sheet gets longer by the minute it seems.␀␀␀␀ˇˇStuff ~i~ students into garbage cans.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇVictims: ~i~␀␀ˇˇClashing with the prefects again?  Will you ever learn?␀␀␀ˇˇThank you so much young man.␀␀ˇˇOh that's so gross!␀␀␀ˇˇI constantly hear your name associated with misdeeds Jimmy.  I don't like it.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇI lost my dog, will you help me?␀␀ˇˇHopkins.  You're done.␀␀␀␀ˇˇCould you find my dog for me?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe mental health people had to be brought in to bring you under control?  Outrageous.␀␀␀␀ˇˇNerd 'piece␀␀␀ˇˇYou Win␀␀␀ˇˇYou gotta get rid of those satelite dishes for me... cable's better anyways, you know?␀␀␀␀ˇˇSo here I am, at probably the worst school in the country,␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe building I live in just got condemned.  Everyone out on the street.  It's awful.␀␀ˇˇBreak those dishes for me and I'll make it worth your while.␀␀ˇˇI suppose you're too busy trying to steal Mr. Galloway's alcohol to pay any attention?␀␀␀␀ˇˇDo not go the wrong way!␀␀ˇˇHey!  You're looking for radios aren't you?␀␀␀ˇˇI betcha there's a treasure on those islands by the pirate ship.  Why don't you go check it out?␀␀ˇˇJimmy, don't be a brat.  Put it on.␀␀␀ˇˇI'd think you'd do well in wrestling class, given your love of violence.  But no.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHave you ever been to a sunken pirate ship?  I bet there's something really cool out there.␀␀␀ˇˇI would recommend not tangling with Johnny Vincent and his friends too much.  One day they may be your colleagues in some menial job somewhere.␀␀␀ˇˇA bit of excercise for you, eh Hopkins?␀␀␀ˇˇStaying up too late is known to cause aggression and bad  behavior.␀␀␀ˇˇA slightly used digital camera.␀␀␀ˇˇLOCKPICK␀␀ˇˇSchool Shorts␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Gym Shorts - Blue␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Gym Shorts - White␀␀ˇˇBullworth Gym Shorts - Red␀␀␀␀ˇˇThanks big guy, you're a good kid you know!␀␀␀ˇˇThey just keep stealing.  Don't they have any respect?␀␀␀␀ˇˇI need you to use that camera of yours to take pictures of those no good graffiti hooligans.␀␀ˇˇMr Hopkins I am of the opinion that some good works would do you a world of good.  Go see the punishment prefect.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've been stealing bikes? What's next, cars?␀␀␀␀ˇˇNice shovel, loser!␀␀␀ˇˇYour aggro management won't save you Hopkins!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDidn't do my homework again, would you help me out?␀␀␀ˇˇDo. Not. Fight. The. Prefects.  Am I making myself clear?␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇDisrespecting teachers will do you no good at Bullworth, young man.␀␀␀ˇˇI see the football team has had to keep you in line.␀␀ˇˇYour costume Jimmy.  Put it on.␀␀␀ˇˇLets have some fun with these water balloons.  See how many people you can hit with 'em ok?␀␀␀ˇˇYou've actually made someone vomit.  That's just disgusting.␀␀ˇˇHey, I know a place you can stay.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇMr. Watts tells me you're a complete failure.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHopkins eh?  I was hoping I wouldn't see you for a while.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇEverybody hates you Jimmy.  Everybody.␀␀␀␀ˇˇLemme tell you about this radio I once saw.␀␀␀ˇˇDo you not know that gambling is a surefire way to ruin?␀␀ˇˇThere is a price for bad behavior Hopkins.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPerhaps a small personal loss will drive home the point.␀␀ˇˇDunk Him!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf your health bar empties, you'll be knocked out.␀␀␀␀ˇˇIf your health bar empties, you'll be knocked out and sent to the infirmary.␀␀ˇˇYour Health Bar is low. Drink some pop to fill it up.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Play game␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇThrowing eggs at cars.  Really Jimmy?  How juvenile.␀␀ˇˇMs. Philips tells me you falling behind in photography class.  Do you have anything to say to that?␀␀␀ˇˇMy camera broke and I need some gritty pictures of the rides.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇJust because you think you're 'the daddy' doesn't make you special in my eyes.␀␀␀␀ˇˇJim, you're a stand up fella. Thank you.␀␀ˇˇHave you ever thought of becoming the school mascot?  Then you'd be somebody.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ School Bus␀␀␀␀ˇˇAvoid running over the flowers or you'll lose money.␀␀ˇˇAvoid destroying the birdbaths and potted plants or you'll lose money.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe ~job~ on the radar represents a job. Follow it to earn some extra cash.␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~dleft~ to scroll through your available jobs.␀␀ˇˇNotice that the ~job~ on the radar blinks.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~t~ to access the save book on your desk and to save your progress.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYour save book is represented by a ~save~ on the radar.␀␀␀ˇˇThere is a save book in the principal's office that you can use.␀␀ˇˇValentine delivered.␀␀ˇˇSnowball Challenge Complete␀␀␀ˇˇBuild up your Special Trick Points␀␀␀␀ˇˇIt was an accident, I apologize.␀␀ˇˇCrash Helmet unlocked.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSmash the car up as much as you can.␀␀ˇˇAwww... That's sweet.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~s~ CAMERA 1␀␀ˇˇ~s~ CAMERA 2␀␀ˇˇ~o~␀␀␀ˇˇ~$~␀␀␀ˇˇThing Done.␀␀␀ˇˇArt␀␀␀ˇˇEnglish␀␀␀ˇˇGym␀␀␀ˇˇBoys Dorm␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou don't have enough money.␀␀ˇˇCrash Helmet␀␀ˇˇViolence - Little Kids␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~t~ EXIT␀␀ˇˇMove Jimmy with the left analog stick. Move the camera with the right analog stick.␀␀␀ˇˇDepending on how hard you push the left analog stick, Jimmy will move at different speeds.␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~dright~ to display your current goal.␀␀ˇˇTHE FINAL CUT␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇWeed Killer␀␀␀ˇˇYou don't have any Meat for Sparky.␀␀␀ˇˇFatty␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou can't hide there when they can see you!␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Town Bike Race 1␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Town Bike Race 2␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Town Bike Race 3␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Town Bike Race 4␀␀␀␀ˇˇNew Coventry Bike Race 1␀␀ˇˇNew Coventry Bike Race 2␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 1␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 2␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 3␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 4␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 5␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 6␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Vale Bike Race 7␀␀␀␀ˇˇBullworth Academy Bike Race 1␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBMX Helmet␀␀␀␀ˇˇFlower delivery complete.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou get tired at 1am. Be in bed by 2am or you'll pass out.␀␀␀␀ˇˇSpray ~i~ prep tag.␀␀␀ˇˇHah hah hah - you are a riot!␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~o~ to jump out of the tree.␀␀␀␀ˇˇAfternoon␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAiming␀␀␀␀ˇˇBuilding␀␀ˇˇ~x~ LOCK␀␀ˇˇPlayer Skill Points:␀␀ˇˇYour health bar is located to the left of the radar.␀␀ˇˇApproach the soda machine and press ~t~ when prompted.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDrinking pop will restore your health.␀␀␀␀ˇˇDrowsy␀␀␀␀ˇˇThe coast is clear... Lead on, captain!␀␀␀ˇˇGrand Prix␀␀␀␀ˇˇBring bikes to Otto for cash.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUse ~s~ to use the shovel.␀␀␀␀ˇˇUse ~L1~ to block.␀␀␀␀ˇˇWrong Part of Town␀␀␀␀ˇˇCONTROLS:␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~x~ to accelerate␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~lstick~ to steer␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~R1~ to fire your rockets␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~s~ to reverse␀␀␀␀ˇˇ~o~ OPEN␀␀ˇˇSkull␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇTEMP: Burning Schoolhouse Firework description␀␀␀␀ˇˇReturn to Pedro for a reward.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGym 1␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGym 2␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGym 3␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGym 4␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇGym 5␀␀␀␀