imes, people will want you to run an errand for them.␀␀␀␀ˇˇThey will have a blue arrow above their head and appear as a ~ambient~ on the radar.␀␀ˇˇTarget Petey with ~L1~ to see what he wants.␀␀ˇˇThe errand details appear under the ~x~ icon on the social menu.␀␀ˇˇHold ~L1~ and press ~x~ to accept the ~errand~ errand.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTo complete the errand, follow the ~ambient~ on the radar.␀␀␀␀ˇˇMwha-ha-ha-ha! <laughing>␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCook's Crush␀␀ˇˇPEA ~i~␀␀␀ˇˇ~i~%␀␀ˇˇFollow the ~ambient~ to get pranks that you can play on other students.␀␀␀ˇˇTATTOO␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou've earned the Go-Kart.␀␀␀␀ˇˇTo get girls to kiss you, you will have to find flowers or chocolates that you can give to them.␀␀ˇˇ> < -␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇ; = -␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇCharge␀␀␀␀ˇˇHold␀␀ˇˇ~R1~ / ~R2~ -␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇScroll␀␀␀␀ˇˇZoom␀␀ˇˇBike returned.␀␀␀␀ˇˇBoxing Boots␀␀ˇˇDunk Tank␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇHold ~L3~ to look back and see what is behind you.␀␀␀␀ˇˇFunhouse␀␀ˇˇPress ~x~ ~o~␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇSwirly ~i~ students.␀␀ˇˇThanks man! ␀␀ˇˇThanks! Here you go! ␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇAll greasers knocked out.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYour bed becomes available at 7pm. Follow the ZZZs to get back to your dorm room.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇUse your bed to go to sleep and wake up fresh at 8am sharp.␀␀␀ˇˇMain Map␀␀ˇˇ~t~ Tilt painting␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇFreak Show␀␀␀␀ˇˇPrank Failed␀␀ˇˇ~t~ to exit␀␀␀ˇˇThe pirate got the best of you. Try again later.␀␀ˇˇClown Wig␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou can break into any locker that has a red lock icon in front of it.␀␀␀␀ˇˇYou can hide in any locker that has a blue lock icon in front of it.␀␀ˇˇYou're trespassing. Watch out for authority figures.␀␀ˇˇThe ~objective~ on the radar is your destination.␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇNotice that the ~objective~ on the radar blinks.␀␀ˇˇYou failed to get the bear.␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~R1~ to throw your weapon.␀␀ˇˇTrespassing␀␀␀ˇˇEgg the Preps.␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, stop that!␀␀␀ˇˇStop fighting!␀␀␀␀ˇˇHey, stop or I'll call the police! ␀␀␀ˇˇBracelet - Gold␀␀␀ˇˇBracelet - Silver␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇBracelet - Steel␀␀ˇˇBracelet - Onyx␀␀␀ˇˇStudent Canned.␀␀␀ˇˇSnowballed~n~Victims: ~i~␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇPress ~L2~ or ~R2~ to scroll through your weapon wheel and equip 